# game/script.rpy:40
translate english start_a65bb5b8:

    # "人人都知道天帝有七个儿子，而每位仙君传说都是春闺少女的梦中人。"
    "Everyone knows that the Heavenly Emperor has seven sons. Each one of his sons is said to be the prince charming for every girl, be it celestial beings or mortals"

# game/script.rpy:41
translate english start_03e6bc63:

    # "天庭里，人人都称呼他们为“郎君”。 若是长子， 就是“大郎”， 次子为“二郎”，三子是“三郎”。 以此类推。"
    "The Imperial Court Officials of Heaven often call the heavenly princes, \"Langjun\", or “mister”. The eldest is Da Lang, the second son is Er Lang, third is San Lang, and so forth."

# game/script.rpy:42
translate english start_225989de:

    # "这千年间，仙君们一直都在修行,偶尔去凡间逛逛。让人出乎意外的是一介凡人董永竟然和七郎在人间定情。想到这里，我就纳闷了。"
    "For a thousand years, the heavenly princes would occasionally go to the Mortal Realm for cultivation."
    "As if by fate, one of the princes, the seventh prince, pledged his everlasting love with Dong Yong, a mere mortal. I am already bored by reminiscing to this point."

# game/script.rpy:43
translate english start_d346c514:

    # "我好歹也是掌管天河十万水军的统帅，怎么和七郎百年的相识都抵不过凡间的数十年?"
    "I am the goddess of warfare and the commanding officer of the Celestial Rivers who is responsible for 100,000 navies."
    "Yet, compared to Qi Lang's (the Seventh Prince) handful of years in the Mortal Realm, our century-long friendship meant almost nothing to him?"

# game/script.rpy:44
translate english start_cb764524:

    # "其余的仙君是否哪天也会钟情于人呢？"
    "Will the rest of the Heavenly princes also fall in love with a human one day?"

# game/script.rpy:45
translate english start_f063a8ad:

    # "本来七郎和董永之间是一段美谈，可当天帝知道这段姻缘后，七郎就被逐出了天庭。"
    "Initially, Qi Lang's and Dongyong's love was a beautiful story."
    "However, when the Heavenly Emperor found out about their marriage, Qi Lang was exiled from Heaven."

# game/script.rpy:46
translate english start_6e6b6335:

    # "从此以后，其余六位仙君也不能与人间的凡夫俗子有任何往来。"
    "From now on, the remaining 6 heavenly princes cannot form any relationships with mortals."

# game/script.rpy:47
translate english start_a7830753:

    # "每次几位仙君修炼出关后，我都有买他们定制的丹药，送各种奇珍异宝只为博君一笑。"
    "So whenever one of the Langjuns returns from the Mortal Realm, I would purchase each of their customized potions in hopes of getting a smile back."

# game/script.rpy:48
translate english start_cb6bb68b:

    # "以往买了丹药之后，我开心的能添两碗饭。随便就能和土地公吃一只烧鸡，顺便和八仙下个棋。"
    "In the past, when I bought the special potions, they always put me in a good mood. To the point that I could eat 2 extra bowls of rice."
    "I could also casually share a roast duck with the Earth God and play chess with the Eight Immortals."

# game/script.rpy:49
translate english start_56347506:

    # "可是我今天却有些惆怅，因为又一位仙君被定下了婚约。"
    "But today I feel a bit melancholy because another Heavenly Prince got engaged."

# game/script.rpy:51
translate english start_56bb4a65:

    # "我的手下，茄子，一直专注在桌上的菜，也不帮我好好分析。看到他的苦瓜脸，我就知道只能靠自己了。"
    "My underling, Eggplant, was so focused on the dishes on the table, he's not even helping me analyze my situation."
    "Just seeing his bitterly sad face, I know I can only rely on myself."

# game/script.rpy:52
translate english start_97fe3436:

    # zuc "元帅现在不缺权利，声望，何必为情所困呢？来来，我从月老那里拿了一罐上好的酒，小的给您满上。"
    zuc "Commander, you do not lack power or status so why are you bothered by love?"
    zuc "Come come, I went to the God of Love and brought back this jar of fine wine! I will fill a glass for you."

# game/script.rpy:54
translate english start_56450aaa:

    # mc "(喝了一口)这是什么酒啊？怎么感觉有些兴奋？"
    mc "(I took a sip) What kind of wine is this? Why am I feeling excited?"

# game/script.rpy:56
translate english start_e8ac92cc:

    # zuc "(点头)这是我专门给您找来壮胆的呀，您不是喜欢那几位仙君吗? 有句话是什么来着？什么鲜花和什么牛X？"
    zuc "(Nods) I specifically found you this wine to give you courage. Don't you fancy those heavenly princes?"
    zuc "What is that saying? Something flower and something something cow or something?"

# game/script.rpy:57
translate english start_674dc34a:

    # zuc "所以您和那些仙君的迷妹们就差一杯壮胆酒，来来，我再给您满上-- "
    zuc "That is why you and the rest of the fair lords' fans are all missing this glass of “Courage” wine. Come come, I'll pour you another glass."

# game/script.rpy:59
translate english start_c8cc2621:

    # "看来茄子以为我喝醉了，他这是在贬低老娘啊， 我选择"
    "Looks like Eggplant thinks I'm drunk already.  Is he belittling me? I choose to——"

# game/script.rpy:62
translate english start_51b5686e:

    # "茄子是不是觉得本仙子好欺负？"
    "Does he think I'm a pushover?"

# game/script.rpy:63
translate english start_1a98e491:

    # "我二话没说直接就把酒倒在他的头上，他震惊了一秒后，马上又笑脸相迎"
    "Without saying another word, I pour the rest of the wine over his head. He is surprised for a second then immediately greets me with a smile."

# game/script.rpy:66
translate english start_6ff7889d:

    # "虽然我有些醉了，可是茄子这话中话，我倒是听出来了。我随手也就是一巴掌扇在他的脸上。"
    "Even though I am a bit tipsy, I still understood Eggplant's words.  I casually raise my hand and slap it on his face."

# game/script.rpy:69
translate english scene1_1_d4fc019e:

    # "由于我的武力值超高，茄子被我揍到脸变成臃肿后才反应过来，他马上就跪地求饶。"
    "Due to how powerful my martial art is, Eggplant's face swells up. He quickly realizes what has happened and knelt in fear, begging for mercy."

# game/script.rpy:71
translate english scene1_1_a5e92217:

    # "我的脸慢慢发烫，看来这酒还挺烈的。我随手打开门，离开了我的府邸。"
    "My face is slowly burning up. It seems like this wine is strong. I simply open the door and leave my manor."

# game/script.rpy:74
translate english scene1_1_c414b57e:

    # "随着醉意，我漫步到了天庭以南的竹林外。"
    "With my drunkenness, I slowly wander to the outside of the bamboo forest located on the southside of Heaven."

# game/script.rpy:75
translate english scene1_1_83eb36af:

    # "我到底是钟情于哪种仙君呢？ (先保存，每个都看看吧）"
    "What kind of Heavenly Princes will I fall in love with?  (Save first and look at each one)"

# game/script.rpy:79
translate english scene1_1_728769fb:

    # "六郎 好感 + 5"
    "Affinity points for Liu Lang + 5"

# game/script.rpy:83
translate english scene1_1_0fcab6a1:

    # "二郎 好感 + 5"
    "Affinity points for Er Lang + 5"

# game/script.rpy:87
translate english scene1_1_1fc48f7e:

    # "五郎 好感 + 5"
    "Affinity points for Wu Lang + 5"

# game/script.rpy:91
translate english scene1_1_e1e1469e:

    # "大郎 好感 + 5"
    "Affinity points for Da Lang + 5"

# game/script.rpy:95
translate english scene1_1_ca60c9de:

    # "四郎 好感 + 5"
    "Affinity points for Si Lang + 5"

# game/script.rpy:99
translate english scene1_1_5ccdf3ef:

    # "三郎 好感 + 5"
    "Affinity points for San Lang + 5"

# game/script.rpy:103
translate english scene1_2_444f34ba:

    # "望着远方，我看到二郎在仙雾竹林里采药。"
    "Looking into the distance, I spotted Er Lang collecting magical herbs in the forest."

# game/script.rpy:104
translate english scene1_2_b1be22fd:

    # "他是王母最喜爱的儿子，平日守礼法，最近还当上了司法天神。近日，他和东海九公主才刚刚订亲。"
    "He is the favorite son of the Empress of Heaven. A law-abiding, young prince who recently became a member of the Judicial Court."
    "Recently, he's engaged with the ninth princess of the East China Sea"
# game/script.rpy:105
translate english scene1_2_d261fd00:

    # "他有一个只有我知道的小秘密。"
    "But he's got a secret that only I know of."

# game/script.rpy:106
translate english scene1_2_4cbc2426:

    # "如此遵守司法的仙君却暗地里施药给贫苦的凡人。若是生死有命，他又是在执着些什么呢？"
    "As celestial beings, we shouldn't interfere with mortal lives."
    "Yet he never hesitates on helping the old and poor. If everything is up to fate, then what makes him go against the natural courses of life?"

# game/script.rpy:107
translate english scene1_2_ba7e9670:

    # two "忘尘仙子，怎么突然也来到这仙雾竹林了？我还以为你会直接去蟠桃宴会上。"
    two "Goddess, why are you also here in the bamboo forest? I thought you would go directly to the peach banquet."

# game/script.rpy:108
translate english scene1_2_45003199:

    # mc "不就是几个桃子嘛，我又不馋几个果子。"
    mc "It's only a few peaches, not that I care much about it."

# game/script.rpy:109
translate english scene1_2_3083b340:

    # mc "镇元大仙的人参果虽然可以让人延年益寿，法力大增，我倒觉得不怎么惊奇"
    mc "Lord Zhenyuan's ginseng fruit can prolong our life force and increase our magic damage. However, it is not something overly special to me."

# game/script.rpy:111
translate english scene1_2_869342b3:

    # two "（若有所思）也是。 还记得五百年前，七郎还曾说在这次的宴会他会给众人一个惊喜。而如今也只是物是人非了。"
    two " (In deep thoughts) Perhaps so. I still remember 500 years ago when Qilang said he would surprise everyone at this banquet, but now it is what it is."

# game/script.rpy:112
translate english scene1_2_c3d7181e:

    # two "(想到什么，似乎有些失落)仙子早已见过无数的王朝复兴,金戈铁马，而且已修得真身，自然对永生没有太大的兴趣。"
    two "(Thinking about something, he frowns) As a goddess, you have seen countless collapses and rises of dynasties, battles against our worst enemies, and you've obtained immortality."
    two "Naturally, you won't be interested in something you already possess."

# game/script.rpy:113
translate english scene1_2_f3b5752c:

    # two "可若是人就难逃生老病死，死前还要面对死亡的恐惧。好像怎么都逃不过劫数。"
    two "However if it is a mortal, they can never escape the cycle of life and must face the fear of death. There seems to be no escape."

# game/script.rpy:114
translate english scene1_2_b545f923:

    # mc "（醉醺醺的指着）这些个仙草难道要用来医治凡人的血肉之躯？"
    mc "(Tipsy) So are these magical herbs being used to heal mortal bodies?"

# game/script.rpy:116
translate english scene1_2_14978c21:

    # two "(似乎是被猜中了心思，他面目一怔）你怎么--"
    two "(As if his secret has been found. His face is frozen) “How do you…"

# game/script.rpy:117
translate english scene1_2_0a814528:

    # "大概是喝醉了，我觉得身体不由自主地向着地面斜去。头也昏沉沉的。微弱的意识让我知道。。。"
    " Maybe because I am drunk. I feel my body tilt toward the ground involuntarily. My head feels dizzy. Subconsciously, I know that—"

# game/script.rpy:118
translate english scene1_2_82dc5be1:

    # "肯定是一个温柔的人把我接住了。"
    "It must be a gentle person that caught me."

# game/script.rpy:119
translate english scene1_2_85cab2d4:

    # mc "你真是一个好人啊。若我是一个平凡的女人肯定把你娶回家"
    mc "You are such a good person. If I am just an ordinary woman I would take you home."

# game/script.rpy:121
translate english scene1_2_7e3fc45a:

    # two "说些什么胡话。"
    two "Stop saying such nonsense."

# game/script.rpy:122
translate english scene1_2_d3aaae63:

    # mc "（抓住袖子）若是我是一个平凡的女人，就算是潜水也要把你从龙宫带出来。绝不让你娶东海九公主。"
    mc "(Holding onto his sleeve) If I was an ordinary woman, I would dive into the Dragon Palace and take you away. I will never let you marry the 9th princess of the East China Sea."

# game/script.rpy:123
translate english scene1_2_8471e897:

    # mc "（嘀咕）奈何现在有十万水军也抢不回来一个你。"
    mc "(Muttering) But now even with a fleet of 100,000 men, I still cannot bring you back."

# game/script.rpy:124
translate english scene1_2_dc7561fe:

    # two "（摇摇头）你喝醉了。"
    two "(Shaking his head) You're drunk."

# game/script.rpy:126
translate english scene1_2_9f67f351:

    # "我下意识抓住了他的衣领，不小心一扯就撕破了黑色的衣衫。然后剩下来的事情都不记得了。"
    "I subconsciously grab onto his collar and accidentally tear his black garment. I do not remember anything else after that"

# game/script.rpy:129
translate english scene1_2_b8fcd670:

    # dude1 "把人带上来！"
    dude1 "Bring her forward!"

# game/script.rpy:131
translate english scene1_2_5a0d0adb:

    # mc "陛下，小仙犯了何错？怎么今日被押到凌霄宝殿来？"
    mc "Your Highness, what crime have I committed? Why am I being escorted to Heaven's Court today?"

# game/script.rpy:133
translate english scene1_2_b693b1ad:

    # dude1 "哼！你调戏仙君，身为统帅，身居高位却明知故犯，罪加一等！来人，把忘尘仙子推出南天门。"
    dude1 "Silence! As a high-ranking Commander, you are well versed with the law yet you did not abide by rules when you harassed a Heavenly Prince."
    dude1 "Now, take the goddess and cast her out to the South Heaven Gate."

# game/script.rpy:134
translate english scene1_2_e0ae4a54:

    # dude1 "此次下凡，你要历经轮回才能再次位列仙班。"
    dude1 "Your punishment is to experience the cycle of life and death in the Mortal Realm. Only then, are you allowed to rejoin the Immortal class."

# game/script.rpy:135
translate english scene1_2_27db9878:

    # "接下来，不由分说，我就被身边一些熟悉当差的兄弟们给押下去了。"
    "Afterward, with nothing I can do, I am taken away by my comrades."

# game/script.rpy:136
translate english scene1_2_c88a24e9:

    # "好歹我也是一个武官，若是我不想被推下去，还真没人拿我有办法。"
    "Luckily I'm a martial officer, if I do not want to be forced down, there is no one that can make me."

# game/script.rpy:137
translate english scene1_2_e15ae6d7:

    # "因为特殊的神力，二十个天兵天将都拿我没辙。"
    "Because of special divine powers, they cannot easily remove me with even 20 men."

# game/script.rpy:138
translate english scene1_2_abeeb0b7:

    # dude1 "怎么区区仙子都推不动？十万水军，动手吧！"
    dude1 "How is it possible that you guys can't even move a goddess? 100,000 navy, do it!"

# game/script.rpy:139
translate english scene1_2_f23613dd:

    # "曾经这些人都是我的部下，这回我有难了，有些人也不好意思动手。一个个别扭的和进错茅房的大爷似的，脸红脖子粗."
    "These men were my subordinates. Seeing the trouble I am in, some cannot follow the order."
    "They each turned red like an embarrassed uncle walking into the wrong bathroom."

# game/script.rpy:140
translate english scene1_2_d81e3d9f:

    # dude1 "寡人养你们这些水军有何用？注了水吗？"
    dude1 "What is the point of keeping you men? Can't you follow some rules?"

# game/script.rpy:142
translate english scene1_2_103a43c1:

    # mc "行了，一人做事一人当！哥们，我会回来的."
    mc "Fine, I'll take the consequences. Brothers, I will be back."

# game/script.rpy:143
translate english scene1_2_aa81c0f4:

    # "说完我就头也不回的往下跳了。基本上和寻死没什么两样，两者都是直奔阴曹地府。"
    "Finishing what I said, I turn around and jump down. This is not much different from committing suicide."
    "Both actions will just take me to Hell."

# game/script.rpy:145
translate english scene1_2_6b6329b0:

    # dude2 "忘尘仙子，上次那个调戏仙女的投错了猪胎。你得小心些啊不要怪我没有提醒你，说不定下一个取西经的就是你了"
    dude2 "Goddess, the last time someone harassed another celestial being, he accidentally reincarnated as a pig."
    dude2 "Don't say I haven't warned you, maybe just like the pig, you will be the next one to seek Holy Scripture from the West."

# game/script.rpy:146
translate english scene1_2_56ecf1e5:

    # dude2 "我其实和玄奘之前聊过，他说以后还有其他僧侣会西行。说不定仙子能成就大业啊！"
    dude2 "I've spoken with Xuanzang, he said from now on there will be more monks taking the pilgrimage to the west."
    dude2 "You never know, you can be contributing to a great cause."

# game/script.rpy:148
translate english scene1_2_1d079806:

    # mc "我到底是招谁惹谁了？"
    mc "Who is tryna mess with me?"

# game/script.rpy:150
translate english scene1_2_9b7b802b:

    # dude2 "天机不可泄露，他日仙子必要重返天庭，那时就明白了。"
    dude2 "Fate cannot be disclosed. When you finally return to the Heavens, you will understand."

# game/script.rpy:152
translate english scene1_2_14c861ba:

    # mc "我的命数是什么？"
    mc "What is my fate?"

# game/script.rpy:154
translate english scene1_2_81957b3a:

    # dude2 "还记得在五百年前的蟠桃宴会上，仙子给我留了一个蟠桃。"
    dude2 "Do you still remember the Peach Banquet 500 years ago? You saved me a peach."

# game/script.rpy:155
translate english scene1_2_e3ab5a63:

    # dude2 "如今我就做个人情，让你自己选以后要成为什么人。"
    dude2 "Today I will return the favor. I will allow you to choose the path you want to walk on."

# game/script.rpy:156
translate english scene1_2_7349a74d:

    # "仙子，走什么线？"
    "Goddess, which route would you take?"

# game/script.rpy:165
translate english scene_a_6d0194d2:

    # "这一世我成为了西凉国的公主。从小就锦衣玉食，也非常受到父皇和母后的疼爱。"
    "In this life, I've become a princess of a massive country --- Xiliang, or Western Liang."
    "Not only do I get to live a comfortable life, but also I have been pampered by my royal parents."

# game/script.rpy:166
translate english scene_a_b912c9c5:

    # "可惜举国上下都沉迷于祭祀和神灵的庇佑，所以就连平常人家都会以卜卦来决定一些重要的事情。"
    "But this whole country is indulged in a cult. We all rely on prophecies to go about our daily matters."

# game/script.rpy:167
translate english scene_a_2899a8d4:

    # "最终导致西凉国的子民们既拜正神也拜邪神。就连皇宫里都是如此。但是怎么会有人承认一国之主会祭拜鬼魂呢？"
    "In the end, some people decide to worship both gods and devils. Even in the palace, most royals worship demons."
    "But who dares to admit the emperor relies on the devil for the future of his land?"

# game/script.rpy:169
translate english scene_a_473c9c11:

    # "平时仗着父母的宠爱，我也喜欢溜出皇宫，看看外面的世界还记得有一次遇到了一个俊俏的少年。"
    "I always fancy my life outside of the palace. I actually met a handsome youth this one time when I sneaked out."

# game/script.rpy:170
translate english scene_a_29ed23f4:

    # "若是只是一个俊俏的郎君倒是不足为奇。 怪就怪在，这个少年对我十分冷淡。微服出访的时候，他连正眼都没看我。"
    "If he's just another cute guy, then it's not really a big deal to me. But, this guy seems to be different. He didn't even look at me in the eye."

# game/script.rpy:171
translate english scene_a_42ffae99:

    # "身为公主，朝里那些大臣的儿子只会对我恭顺听从，一点都没劲。所以这个郎君让我好奇许多。"
    "As a princess, I've always had everything I wanted. Sons of high ranking officials in the royal court had been nothing but obedient to my orders."
    "Unlike them, this youth stands out from the crowd."

# game/script.rpy:172
translate english scene_a_b7a7af02:

    # "我就不信这个宛如仙人的男子不会私动凡心。若是仙人，那他也要为了我这个公主而贬为谪仙。"
    "His paramount beauty is comparable to that of celestial beings. But even if he's a heavenly prince, he must descend down to earth to meet me again."
    "Will love make him abandon his titles or forsake his name?"

# game/script.rpy:174
translate english scene_a_995117cf:

    # mc_1 "阿轩，上次我让你打听的人可有什么线索了？"
    mc_1 "(To my lady-in-waiting) Ah-Xuan, have you gotten any news for me?"

# game/script.rpy:175
translate english scene_a_2da6f198:

    # girl_1 "回禀公主，婢子上次跟着他到了东海湾，接着看到海上刮着大风，最后只看到一条好大的金龙潜入了水里。"
    girl_1 "Yes, your grace. I followed the youth in white to the Eastern China Sea but suddenly lost him when a golden dragon emerged from the sea."

# game/script.rpy:176
translate english scene_a_e2726bf0:

    # mc_1 "胡言乱语！怎么可能会看到金龙？人去哪了？可不要因为你跟丢了人，就做出这等说辞来糊弄本公主。我可不饶你."
    mc_1 "Huh? That doesn't make any sense. How did you see a golden dragon? Are you making up a fairy tale just so that I'd believe you? I cannot tolerate lies."

# game/script.rpy:177
translate english scene_a_33546011:

    # girl_1 "婢子不敢撒谎。上次那位郎君就在东海湾的沙滩消失了。难不成是被金龙给吃了？"
    girl_1 "I'm telling the truth, your grace. He disappeared at the shore. Could it be that he's eaten by the dragon?"

# game/script.rpy:178
translate english scene_a_3093490d:

    # mc_1 "那条龙是蛟龙还是真龙？你可有看清？"
    mc_1 "Hmm, was it a dragon that we worship in court? Was the dragon a deity or demon?"

# game/script.rpy:179
translate english scene_a_d140267c:

    # girl_1 "婢子当时都吓死了，怎么还有时间看这些。但是他的龙鳞看起来和我们平时祭拜的神仙倒有几分相似。是真龙吧。"
    girl_1 "I was too afraid to take a closer look. But his scale looks like those belong to a deity."

# game/script.rpy:180
translate english scene_a_73650cfa:

    # mc_1 "真龙怎么会吃人呢？走，去东海湾看看！今日父皇举办祭祀大典，我可不想看些血腥的事情。"
    mc_1 "Deities would never eat humans. Let's sneak out to the shore again."
    mc_1 "His Imperial Majesty is hosting another sacrificial offering today, I don't want to set my eyes on something so gross."

# game/script.rpy:183
translate english scene_a_39884557:

    # "不想引人注目，我和阿轩两人偷偷离开了皇宫。我们不仅在沙滩上发现了龙的爪印，而且还听到了浪花拍打岩石的声音。"
    "Avoiding unnecessary attention, I sneak out of the palace with my court lady. We find traces of dragon tracks and hear the sound of ocean waves."

# game/script.rpy:184
translate english scene_a_4fa6c094:

    # "前一秒，我还很担心那个对我冷淡的少年已经不慎被大龙吃掉。下一秒却又发现了他站在海边。"
    "For a second, I'm worried about the youth and wonder if he's actually eaten by the dragon. But my concern wholly disappears when he shows up."

# game/script.rpy:185
translate english scene_a_4b51394a:

    # "白色的发带飘在空中，两位男子看起来像极了出尘的仙人。难道旁边的那个人是他的亲友吗？"
    "His white hair bands flow freely in the mid air, and the two guys in front us look just like celestial beings. Is the other guy his friend or brother?"

# game/script.rpy:186
translate english scene_a_7f188ac6:

    # "隔得太远，我只听到海浪声。 稍微走进了几步才听到只字片语。 可惜的是，接下来的对谈我都只听了一半。"
    "They are too far away from us. I can only hear the sound of ocean waves. Unfortunately, I can only hear half of their conversation."

# game/script.rpy:188
translate english scene_a_d3ee0cc6:

    # dude3 "阿兄，还记得儿时我们常来东海游玩。今日何不一起拜访表妹？我也有些时日未曾入海了。"
    dude3 "Brother, we used to come here a lot as children. Why don't we visit our cousin today? I have not been in the dragon palace for a long time."

# game/script.rpy:190
translate english scene_a_cd287a50:

    # dude4 "上次九妹说想要民间的一些食品。今日正好是元灯节，我打算等一下先去买元宵和一些花灯。现在不便入海。"
    dude4 "Our cousin said she wanted snacks from the mortal realm. It's actually the Lantern Festival. I'll need to buy some desserts and lanterns for her."

# game/script.rpy:192
translate english scene_a_3bb4197f:

    # dude3 "你对表妹还真是上心，看来阿兄从来未变。 哪一天等你与凌天玄女结为夫妇，那也得为她多花些心思才是。"
    dude3 "What a caring brother, you really haven't changed, huh? When you get married to the Lingtian Goddess, you should treat her well too."

# game/script.rpy:194
translate english scene_a_0c692b44:

    # dude4 "（有些抵制）这桩婚事也只是年少时的安排，说不定现在也无人当真了。"
    dude4 "(Hesitant) Our engagement isn't even a real thing. Perhaps no one took it seriously. I was so young then."

# game/script.rpy:196
translate english scene_a_2013ffda:

    # dude3 "当年可四大龙王和观音大士都在场，怎可是儿戏？凌天玄女是女娲后人，神力非凡，难不成你不喜欢她？"
    dude3 "Of course everyone took it seriously. The Lingtian Goddess is the heiress of Goddess Nuwa, who created mankind. She's incredibly powerful. Are you not interested in her?"

# game/script.rpy:198
translate english scene_a_6c4a6a56:

    # dude4 "（转移话题）今日是人间的上元节，我们还是先行去买些礼品吧。"
    dude4 "(Changes the subject) We should buy some presents for our cousin, don't keep her waiting."

# game/script.rpy:200
translate english scene_a_bc071681:

    # dude3 "阿兄可去买人间的食品，我已经准备好了寿桃和琼浆玉露，相信龙王一定会欣喜的。"
    dude3 "Oh, you may go first. I have already prepared some gifts, such as peaches of immortality and ambrosia. The Dragon King will be elated."

# game/script.rpy:201
translate english scene_a_45c0a95e:

    # "看来所有人都逃不过父母之命媒妁之言这些可怕的传统啊。"
    "It seems like everyone can't avoid arranged marriages, whether we like it or not. "

# game/script.rpy:202
translate english scene_a_35a15ec4:

    # "一眼望去，我觉得——"
    "Looking into distance, I think——"

# game/script.rpy:210
translate english a_1_851b4806:

    # "接下来的事情让我更加匪夷所思。起初我以为是渔女在海边可是当海水打湿她的双脚时，她的双腿竟然变化成了龙尾！"
    "The next thing really surprises me."
    "At first I just assume a fisherman's daughter is on the other side of the shore, but when her legs touch the ocean water, they turn into a dragon tail!"

# game/script.rpy:211
translate english a_1_04a2ef37:

    # "有些惊慌失措，她试图用仙法把龙尾变成腿。几次之后，她终于成功了。还好阿轩和我只是被惊吓住，没有出声。"
    "Panicking, she tries to use sorcery and hide her tail."
    "After a few attempts, she successfully turns her tail into legs again. We are astonished by this scene, but we hold our tongue."

# game/script.rpy:212
translate english a_1_7759f690:

    # girl_2 "平日表兄们叫我不要出海，可是海底哪有人间好玩？只可惜我的仙术还需练习，不然早就去集市里逛了。"
    girl_2 "My cousins told me not to come out of the ocean, but the deep sea is nothing compared to the mortal realm."
    girl_2 "But I still need to practice sorcery. I can't let humans know of my true form."

# game/script.rpy:213
translate english a_1_1233b7a8:

    # "今日才知道原来鬼神之说还真的存在。也不知道这个少女的身份是如何，我打算先行回宫。"
    "Now we know mythology is actually real. Although we don't know this girl's identity, we decide to return to the palace."

# game/script.rpy:216
translate english a_1_92811037:

    # "夕阳间，宫里的祭祀却还未结束。从正殿传来的惨叫声迟迟未被打断。活人祭祀本来就是无比血腥，更别说有些祭祀品"
    "Around sunset, sacrificial offerings still haven't ended. I can hear some bitter cries from the court. "

# game/script.rpy:217
translate english a_1_a4e16cf1:

    # "几乎都出生于贫苦之家。大多数人为了妻儿，连性命都不要，只为换取银两。父皇说其实有些祭祀品是身患奇难杂症"
    "Using living humans as sacrifices can be such a horrible thing. Many of them come from poor families."
    "Some sacrificed themselves to get a better future for their wives and children."

# game/script.rpy:218
translate english a_1_8784e9f7:

    # "要不然就是得了瘟疫的将死之人。所以他并不觉得有什么问题。这些事情看多了，我也慢慢不去前殿了。"
    "My father said those who decided to sacrifice themselves either had terminal disease or couldn't afford to live."
    "Having seen so much suffering in the palace, I am more reluctant to attend those events."

# game/script.rpy:219
translate english a_1_7b00db84:

    # "而后殿就是父皇祭拜邪神的地方。每个雕塑里都有邪神的真身，而每日必须要活人的鲜血来浸泡。"
    "The rear hall is where my father worships the devils. Every statue contains a spirit, and they all require fresh blood from humans."

# game/script.rpy:220
translate english a_1_3532e535:

    # "每次出宫，我都要经过后殿。所以几乎每次都是跑过去的。"
    "Whenever I want to sneak out, I have to pass by the rear hall. So I usually just run as fast as I can."

# game/script.rpy:223
translate english a_1_639bcd47:

    # "大街小巷早就被人围得水泄不通了。就连吃些点心都要排队尽管阿轩劝我不要吃路边的食物，我的好奇心还是决定要试"
    "Because of the lantern festival, everywhere is crowded. There's queues for everything."
    "Although Ah-Xuan suggests me not to eat street food because they can be unsanitary, I still want to give them a try."

# game/script.rpy:224
translate english a_1_7edb60d5:

    # dude5 "（看着我被眼前的甜品迷得眼花缭乱）姑娘，你要买哪种糖人啊？"
    dude5 "Hey lady, what kind of candy would you like to get?"

# game/script.rpy:226
translate english a_1_053a2e00:

    # mc_1 "我要这个大鸟！（看着店家的偷笑，表示疑惑）怎么，我说不对吗？"
    mc_1 "I want this bird. (Notices how the vendor is laughing, slightly confused) What, did I say something wrong?"

# game/script.rpy:227
translate english a_1_7d125215:

    # dude5 "这个还真不是普通的大鸟，姑娘若是回答对了，老夫就免费赠与你。"
    dude5 "This isn't just some random bird. If you can get it right, I'll give it to you for free."

# game/script.rpy:228
translate english a_1_6b587907:

    # mc_1 "那不成是大鹰？还是雕？也罢，你就告诉我吧，反正我也不缺银子。"
    mc_1 "Is it an eagle? A condor? Hm, just tell me what it is. I've got money."

# game/script.rpy:229
translate english a_1_70a9c5b9:

    # "店家说他今天的生意极好，今日我手上的糖人是他最后几个之一。"
    "The vendor said most of his candies are sold out. What I have in my hand is one of the last few candies."

# game/script.rpy:231
translate english a_1_cd4fbc0a:

    # "然后一个磁性的男声从耳边说道，\"此乃鲲鹏\"."
    "An attractive male voice soon gets my attention."
    "He remarks, \"It's called Roc, a legendary bird that can soar above the heaven yet can also transform into a dragon.\""

# game/script.rpy:232
translate english a_1_daea7d98:

    # dude3 "鲲鹏入水为龙，在天为鹏。生于北冥，却喜爱翱翔于南海。姑娘手上拿的是守卫西凉的神兽之一。"
    dude3 "It's from the Northern Lands, yet usually resides in the South China Sea. Roc used to be the guardian of this country."

# game/script.rpy:233
translate english a_1_456b52a2:

    # "其中一个路人却嬉笑道，“鲲鹏明明是入水为鱼。”"
    "Another stranger teases, \"The Roc turns into a fish in water, not a dragon.\""

# game/script.rpy:234
translate english a_1_1e430750:

    # dude3 "那是因为凡人没见过真正的鲲鹏，自然都是一些说书的乱编一通。"
    dude3 "Well, it's because most people never get to see the real legendary bird. They reinvented a myth of their own."

# game/script.rpy:236
translate english a_1_677e1a64:

    # mc_1 "难不成你见过？真是好大的口气！"
    mc_1 "You sound as if you've seen it before?"

# game/script.rpy:238
translate english a_1_bb6459cf:

    # dude3 "（微微一笑）若不是亲眼所见，小生是绝对不会信的。"
    dude3 "(Lips curl) Of course I have. I'd never believe in something I've never seen before."

# game/script.rpy:239
translate english a_1_d6aaec95:

    # mc_1 "好，那等到你找到龙鳞或者鲲鹏的羽毛再说吧。"
    mc_1 "Why don't you bring me a dragon scale or a feather from the Roc to prove yourself?"

# game/script.rpy:240
translate english a_1_224d48dd:

    # dude3 "那等到日后有缘相见再说吧。"
    dude3 "Well, you may have to wait until some days later."

# game/script.rpy:241
translate english a_1_15cb340d:

    # mc_1 "天下何大？我怎么会知道以后还会不会遇见你？本姑娘最不信的就是缘分了。 就连你的名字都不知道，我怎么找你？"
    mc_1 "The world is a massive place full of uncertainties. How would I know if we'll meet again? "
    mc_1 "I don't believe in serendipity. I don't even know your name, how will I be able to find you?"

# game/script.rpy:242
translate english a_1_8f303f92:

    # two "天下其小，命数和缘分是世人都不可避免的。 小生乃是家中次子，姑娘叫我为二郎便好。"
    two "The world is a small place, with all of our lives predetermined by deities, nothing is subject to change. "
    two "I'm the second oldest in my family. You may call me Er Lang."

# game/script.rpy:243
translate english a_1_8c2d8206:

    # two "（思索一番，递给我一张纸条）也罢，正好是上元节，那请收下吧。无论何时何地，以后若是读了这个就能找到小生了。"
    two "(Engage in thoughts, then pass me a note) Well, it's the lantern festival, I don't have any riddles for you to guess, but you can have a note instead."
    two "No matter where you will be, just read from the note and you'll be able to find me."

# game/script.rpy:244
translate english a_1_9ffd40f9:

    # "\"蛾儿雪柳黄金缕，笑语盈盈暗香去。众里寻他千百度，蓦然回首，那人却在，灯火阑珊处。\"
    "\"But in the crowd once and again, I look for him in vain. When all at once I turn my head, I find him there where lantern light is dimly shed.\""

# game/script.rpy:245
translate english a_1_0249e3d4:

    # "原来是出自南宋诗人辛弃疾。 难道他的意思是要去灯火阑珊处找他？"
    "Oh, it's a poem written by Xin Qiji, a poet from the Southern Song Dynasty. Is he implying that I should find him at where lantern light is dimly shed?"

# game/script.rpy:246
translate english a_1_53ad22cb:

    # "我觉得这个少年很"
    "I think he's-"

# game/script.rpy:249
translate english a_1_dbea6049:

    # "感觉他还是有些傲气，真不喜欢呢。"
    "It's kinda bratty to give a girl a note to read from. I don't like him very much."

# game/script.rpy:252
translate english a_1_dcee7b8b:

    # "这个郎君倒是挺有意思的，下次还能再相见吗？"
    "Oh, he's really creative. Will I meet him again?"

# game/script.rpy:255
translate english a_2_6464b236:

    # mc_1 "（重复他的话）无论何时何地？（摇摇头）恐怕是过了几个落花时节都不能再次相遇吧。"
    mc_1 "(Repeat after him) No matter where I will be? (Shake my head) I bet we won't see each other again even after a few seasons."

# game/script.rpy:256
translate english a_2_3f380adc:

    # two "在下要先去其他铺子买些膳食，若是不信等一下来找我啊。"
    two "Why don't you give it a try later? I gotta go buy some snacks. Catch you later."

# game/script.rpy:257
translate english a_2_42f5ffda:

    # mc_1 "好，若是敢骗我，就算你跑到天涯海角本姑娘也饶不了你。"
    mc_1 "Alright, but if you dare to trick me, I will chase you down and give you the worst punishment."

# game/script.rpy:259
translate english a_2_ac665a73:

    # "越过几个小巷，彩色云朵慢慢消失在眼前，缀满星空的黑夜降临了。"
    "After I traverse across a few streets, all the colorful clouds slowly disappear before my eyes. "
    "There's a thousand stars hanging above the sky."

# game/script.rpy:260
translate english a_2_6ece85e1:

    # "在这个繁华的街道上，我听到了妇女们的盈盈般的笑声，而周围的花灯也照亮了黑漆漆的夜空。"
    "I'm in the prosperous part of the city, and I can hear women laughing while celebrating the holiday with their most beloved ones"
    "Beautiful lanterns are almost everywhere."

# game/script.rpy:262
translate english a_2_d99e6aed:

    # "前面不正是之前的那个冷漠少年吗？不敢相信前些天遇见的冰块脸竟然笑了。"
    "Wait, is that the cold, indifferent guy that I've met a while ago? I can't believe he just smiled."

# game/script.rpy:263
translate english a_2_2f3fb7d1:

    # "花香在空气中飘散着，而那白皙的少年 有着姣好的面容。他是为了什么而欣喜或者是为了谁而欣喜？"
    "Sweet fragrance is in the air. The fair-skinned youth has a pretty countenance. Is he smiling because he's thinking of someone?"

# game/script.rpy:264
translate english a_2_2195bb9a:

    # "看着他左手拿着的胭脂，我猜到肯定是要送给哪家的姑娘吧。我感到"
    "He's holding a blush in his left hand, it has to be a gift for a woman. I feel-"

# game/script.rpy:267
translate english a_2_4009cb45:

    # "就算元宵节的花灯铺满了繁华的街道，可是我心里却感到苦涩。难道冰块脸已经有喜欢的人了？"
    "Despite being surrounded by so many beautiful lanterns, I feel a little bitter inside. Is he already in love with someone?"

# game/script.rpy:270
translate english a_2_cfbe2f0d:

    # "其实我现在还不太认识冰块脸，若是他有喜爱的姑娘了，也是情有可原的。"
    "Actually, we've only met once. I don't know much about him, so even if he has a crush on someone, it makes total sense."

# game/script.rpy:274
translate english a_3_fd1f2c14:

    # mc_1 "冰块脸，你也来逛街啊？"
    mc_1 "Hey ice-cubed face, didn't expect to see you here."

# game/script.rpy:276
translate english a_3_35cb2202:

    # dude4 "（不悦）你叫本座什么？"
    dude4 "(Displeased) What did you call me?"

# game/script.rpy:278
translate english a_3_f0d966d8:

    # mc_1 "自然是冰块脸。前些日子我们碰过面，只是你连名字都没有告诉我就直接走了。"
    mc_1 "Ice-cubed face. We've met before, but you just never told me your name."

# game/script.rpy:280
translate english a_3_9ecd699e:

    # dude4 "我在家是长子，姑娘叫我大郎便好。下一次，若是你还唤我冰块脸，那本尊必然不会理你。"
    dude4 "I'm the oldest in the family. Most acquaintances call me Da Lang. But if you're going to call me something else, I'll not respond to you again."

# game/script.rpy:282
translate english a_3_ab977bb7:

    # mc_1 "（放下手中的糖人）那也行，只是你说话的时候别摆架子，可好？"
    mc_1 "(Put down the candy) Sure, but can you sound less arrogant when speaking to me?"

# game/script.rpy:284
translate english a_3_6b0c228b:

    # dude4 "（突然想到什么）女孩子们都喜欢吃甜的吗？"
    dude4 "(Thought about something) Do girls usually like to eat something sweet?"

# game/script.rpy:286
translate english a_3_dcb82d26:

    # mc_1 "不是所有姑娘都喜欢，但是我倒是爱吃甜的，嘻嘻。"
    mc_1 "Not all girls, but I do, haha."

# game/script.rpy:288
translate english a_3_8844e2ed:

    # dude4 "（点了点头）九妹一定也喜欢。"
    dude4 "(Nod) Jiumei probably likes it too."

# game/script.rpy:290
translate english a_3_16a9035e:

    # mc_1 "什么？是想给妹妹送礼物啊？走，本姑娘带你去选花灯！"
    mc_1 "Huh? Are you tryna get something for your sister? I can show you around. They're selling lanterns."

# game/script.rpy:292
translate english a_3_1d817fd7:

    # "走在人群里，我常常转过身去看看他还有没有在跟着。幸好冰块脸有继续在我身后。"
    "Walking amongst the crowds, I turn around every few minutes to check in with him. Gladly, he's still behind me."

# game/script.rpy:294
translate english a_3_b2100bbe:

    # "走到半路，我看到了另一个貌若潘安的少年，只是他看起来好像有点闷闷不乐，是不是迷路了？"
    "On our way there, I see another handsome youth in turquoise. He looks pretty distraught, could it be that he's lost?"

# game/script.rpy:295
translate english a_3_9d14c253:

    # "他身穿着青色的衣衫，气质出众。他时不时就东张西望，恐怕真的是迷路了。"
    "His turquoise outfit makes him stand out. He looks aimless into the thin air, perhaps he really is lost"

# game/script.rpy:296
translate english a_3_55b1c999:

    # "我应该怎么做？"
    "What should I do?"

# game/script.rpy:304
translate english a_4_1_fe402791:

    # "我和大郎还有侍女走散后就去找了刚才的青衣少年。他有些苦恼的坐在某人家的梯子上。"
    "I can no longer find my lady-in-waiting or Da Lang, so I decide to help with youth instead. Frowning, he sits silently on the stairs"

# game/script.rpy:306
translate english a_4_1_991c3d8b:

    # mc_1 "看你是外地人吧。在西凉好久没有人穿的这么朴素了。"
    mc_1 "Aren't you a new face in the capital city? I've never seen someone dressed so plain before."

# game/script.rpy:308
translate english a_4_1_a589c463:

    # dude6 "姑娘可有什么事吗？"
    dude6 "Lady, do you have any questions?"

# game/script.rpy:309
translate english a_4_1_92c54cc5:

    # mc_1 "（坐在他身旁）看你刚才东张西望的，是不是迷路啦？"
    mc_1 "(Sit down beside him) Well, I'm concerned about you. You kept looking around for directions. Are you lost?"

# game/script.rpy:310
translate english a_4_1_ed3e1ec8:

    # dude6 "（呆萌的点了点头）嗯，可是附近有土地庙。我去问问土地就好了。"
    dude6 "(Nods) I am, but there's a temple in vicinity. I just need to get help from the earth god."

# game/script.rpy:312
translate english a_4_1_e5e6c6ab:

    # mc_1 "啊？哦， 可是现在庙祝现在肯定很忙的。而且你这么打坐着也不是办法呀。"
    mc_1 "Huh? But the priest must be really busy. And meditating won't help you."

# game/script.rpy:313
translate english a_4_1_a4da6fd8:

    # dude6 "可是我的师父说若是慌张和心有杂念的时候就要打坐，这样才能平静下来。"
    dude6 "My grandmaster said if I ever feel nervous or anxious, I should always practice meditation to reach a moment of peace."

# game/script.rpy:314
translate english a_4_1_ee804e3e:

    # mc_1 "这治标不治本的。说吧，想去哪里，本姑娘带你玩遍西凉。"
    mc_1 "Meditation can't direct you to different places. Where do you want to go?"

# game/script.rpy:316
translate english a_4_1_bb8e6c5b:

    # dude6 "（脸上一阵红）我肚子饿了。"
    dude6 "(Blushes) I'm hungry."

# game/script.rpy:317
translate english a_4_1_9834ce34:

    # mc_1 "那我带你去吃东西吧。前面不就正好有个酒楼吗？"
    mc_1 "Well, let me take you somewhere to grab some meals. Oh, there's a restaurant down there."

# game/script.rpy:319
translate english a_4_1_09d9551e:

    # "在这之前我在花灯前的许愿树旁许了一个愿望。这回带着这个少年去吃东西可千万不要出什么乱子了。"
    "Before I go, I decide to make a wish in front of a cherry blossom tree. I hope nothing will go wrong as we get dinner"

# game/script.rpy:325
translate english a_4_2_0c487227:

    # "在拥挤的人群里，我们渐渐地快要走散了。这时，他伸出手，将我从人群的另一边拉回了他的身边。"
    "This massive crowd grows bigger in size, and some passing pedestrians have pushed me away from the youth in white. "
    "Before I can recollect myself, he gives me a hand to grasp on, pulling me closer to him."

# game/script.rpy:326
translate english a_4_2_f3eeb50d:

    # "神奇的是，他的手一点都不冰冷。在这上百人的街道上，茫茫人海里，快要被分散的我们却因为他的一个举动而让我再次回到了他的身旁。"
    "To my surprise, his hand isn't cold like his personality."
    "Amongst hundreds and perhaps, even thousands of people, he leans in and takes my hand, so we can be reunited despite the great influx of people."

# game/script.rpy:327
translate english a_4_2_897e6a72:

    # "他优美的身姿让我觉得心跳加速，一时不知所措。在他牵我手的时候，我看见了路上成双成对的情侣。好似我和大郎的缘分远远超过了只有一面之缘的陌生人。"
    "His elegant figure makes my heart race. As he holds my hand, I see other couples on the other side of the street, hand in hand. "
    "It's as if at this moment, we're more than just acquaintances."

# game/script.rpy:328
translate english a_4_2_664f5b47:

    # one "从刚才就在发什么呆呢？前面就是花灯店了。"
    one "Don't just stand here, we're almost there."

# game/script.rpy:330
translate english a_4_2_ba8e26f0:

    # dude5 "这位郎君要买花灯赠与佳人否？"
    dude5 "Would you like to buy a lantern for the lady?"

# game/script.rpy:331
translate english a_4_2_737fcff2:

    # one "嗯，既然老伯还剩这么多花灯，其余的我都买下了。这夜路不好走，就把整条街都换上彩灯吧。"
    one "Yes, I would. You still have a lot of lanterns left. I'll get everything you have. "
    one "This street can be a bit dark at night, why don't you hang all the extra lanterns so people can see the road ahead?"

# game/script.rpy:332
translate english a_4_2_6d9b2542:

    # one "（偏过头，不看我）既然是最后几个花灯了，你就顺便收下吧。"
    one "(Turns away, not looking at me) Well, there's still a couple lanterns left. Why don't you take one too?"

# game/script.rpy:334
translate english a_4_2_03c0f8d4:

    # mc_1 "夜间的冷风吹乱了我的发丝，却让我的双颊添了红润的颜色）送给我的？"
    mc_1 "(The chilly wind makes my hair more frizzy, yet adds color to my cheeks) Oh, is it for me?"

# game/script.rpy:335
translate english a_4_2_a6e8b05b:

    # one "（递给我花灯）反正这里也挂不下了。"
    one "(Passes me a lantern) Well, there's not gonna be enough room for the street."

# game/script.rpy:336
translate english a_4_2_623c17b6:

    # "我只是发愣一下，大郎就转眼间不见了。留下的就只有手中明亮的花灯。"
    "This must be my cue to accept his gift. As far as I know, giving away a lantern can be a romantic gesture."
    "Before I can say something else, he is already gone. The only thing left is the bright lantern."

# game/script.rpy:337
translate english a_4_2_3d0cc801:

    # "他明明是一个善良的男子，为什么对我却怎么冷漠呢？普天之下，是否有对他例外的人呢？"
    "It seems like he is a good man, but why is he acting so cold? Is there someone that he treats differently?"

# game/script.rpy:339
translate english a_4_2_5296591a:

    # "于是我在花灯前的许愿树下许下了一个只有自己知道的秘密。"
    "Under the cherry blossom tree, I make a wish that only I know of."

# game/script.rpy:343
translate english a_4_3_3ab2e33d:

    # "之后我遇见了青衣少年就打算带他先去填饱肚子。不管怎么样，总不能我堂堂公主让一个外来的子民在我西凉挨饿吧。"
    "Later on as I meet the youth with a turquoise outfit, I decide to take him to a restaurant. As a princess, I feel obligated to feed anyone with a hungry stomach."

# game/script.rpy:344
translate english a_4_3_3c0887d0:

    # "来到这个永安酒楼后，我就找了个位子和青衣少年坐下。"
    "As we go to the Yong-An restaurant, we quickly find ourselves a seat."

# game/script.rpy:346
translate english a_4_3_540f84ae:

    # "他进来的时候兴许是快被饿晕了，不小心撞在了柱子上。"
    "Perhaps the youth is too famished. He walks into a pole and it hits his right cheek."

# game/script.rpy:347
translate english a_4_3_17898368:

    # "于是右脸被擦伤了。奇怪的是，他一进来就看着财神的雕塑，但是又失望的低下头。"
    "It's strange how he keeps staring at a sculpture of the god of fortune. Yet he lowers his head in disappointment."

# game/script.rpy:348
translate english a_4_3_b70744ce:

    # dude6 "这家店里没有财神，光是买了塑像不好生供奉是不行的。"
    dude6 "I cannot sense the god of fortune in this restaurant. They shouldn't just buy a sculpture without making any offerings."

# game/script.rpy:350
translate english a_4_3_d2e535cc:

    # mc_1 "而且这个凳子也挺晃的，是不是有点年代久远了？哇，有一个角矮了一截，我就说嘛。"
    mc_1 "And this chair is so old that it has a missing corner."

# game/script.rpy:352
translate english a_4_3_e0aeeaf8:

    # lady "年轻人就是不懂，这财神爷我每天用新鲜的露水供奉。而我们店的的红木凳子可是曾经杨贵妃坐过的。"
    lady "You young kids just don't understand. I always use fresh morning dew as an offering to the god. And our mahogany chair used to be a possession of the royals"

# game/script.rpy:353
translate english a_4_3_bd79acdb:

    # lady "（得意的扇扇子）不懂可别乱说话。"
    lady "(Fans herself) Don't pretend like you know it all."

# game/script.rpy:355
translate english a_4_3_a00c12b9:

    # dude6 "（表示惊讶）啊，用白水来供奉神仙？难怪财神爷不肯来。更别说这椅子了，看起来不像红木啊。"
    dude6 "(Astonished) Huh, you use water as offerings to gods? No wonder why the god of fortune is unwilling to be here. And this chair doesn't look like it's made of mahogany."

# game/script.rpy:357
translate english a_4_3_9f075f2e:

    # lady "（恼羞成怒，卷起袖子）你这小兔崽子，我们店里生意极好，常年有财神爷的庇佑。看你穿的这么朴素，我看连上等的红木都没见过吧。"
    lady "(Upset, rolls up her sleeve) You little jerk. Our restaurant has been blessed by the god of fortune. You're wearing such a plain outfit, I bet you've never seen mahogany before."

# game/script.rpy:359
translate english a_4_3_8492e643:

    # girl_2 "（拦住了掌柜）行了，娘，你去前柜先算算账吧。这边有我呢。"
    girl_2 "(Tries to calm her down) Mom, why don't you help someone at the counter? I'll take care of them."

# game/script.rpy:360
translate english a_4_3_d0bf6c69:

    # girl_2 "(微笑的看着我们）客官，我们这儿是吃饭的。若是肚子饿了就得点几道小菜。若是嫌弃我们装潢不好，那你也可以捐修。"
    girl_2 "(Smiles) Well, we're a small family business. If you're hungry, then just order some delicious meals to fill up your stomach."
    girl_2 "If you want better chairs and desks, then we're glad to take some donations."

# game/script.rpy:362
translate english a_4_3_2912575b:

    # mc_1 "你们这有什么好吃的都上来。本姑娘有的是钱。（说完这句话，店主和少女都乐开花了）"
    mc_1 "Just bring all the good food here. Anything featured. I'm rich anyways. (Both the mom and her daughter's faces are lit up)"

# game/script.rpy:363
translate english a_4_3_9f98fada:

    # mc_1 "对了，小子，你叫什么名字？"
    mc_1 "Oh, yeah. So what's your name?"

# game/script.rpy:365
translate english a_4_3_374a9bb5:

    # six "（看着菜色佳肴，开始拿起碗筷）我是六郎。"
    six "(Looks at all the dishes, picks up his utensils) I'm Liu Lang, the sixth son in my family."

# game/script.rpy:367
translate english a_4_3_1d2d7652:

    # mc_1 "下一次可别说什么财神没来店里的这些胡话了，本姑娘可不想被人以为（指着头）这儿有问题。"
    mc_1 "Well, next time don't say things like the god of fortune didn't make his presence here."
    mc_1 "I don't want people to think (points at his head) we've got a problem here."

# game/script.rpy:369
translate english a_4_3_0a9793d9:

    # six "（赌气放下碗筷）哼，你说谁这儿有问题？我没骗你，真的没有！"
    six "(Puts down his utensils) Huh, what? What are you implying? I swear I'm not lying."

# game/script.rpy:370
translate english a_4_3_bf82147b:

    # mc_1 "好啦，小傻子，吃完再说吧。"
    mc_1 "Alright, silly thing. Just eat your dinner."

# game/script.rpy:371
translate english a_4_3_cc3db696:

    # six "（偏过头）我不吃。"
    six "(Turns his head away) No, I'm not going to."

# game/script.rpy:372
translate english a_4_3_197f3185:

    # mc_1 "（疑惑）难道这菜不好吃？民间的小菜就凑合吃吧。"
    mc_1 "(Confused) Oh, do you not like the food here? Don't expect too much from food outside the palace, I guess."

# game/script.rpy:373
translate english a_4_3_cd28e76a:

    # six "（生闷气）不是。"
    six "(Upset) No, that's not why I'm upset."

# game/script.rpy:374
translate english a_4_3_4ee7e662:

    # mc_1 "那是为什么？"
    mc_1 "Then tell me why."

# game/script.rpy:375
translate english a_4_3_2226a66c:

    # six "（有些气恼）你叫我小傻子，可是我不傻啊。"
    six "You called me a silly thing, but I'm not silly."

# game/script.rpy:377
translate english a_4_3_8d952528:

    # mc_1 "哈哈，原来是为了这个啊。（转了转眼睛，想到些什么）可是在西凉女子只会对特别的人才叫小傻子哦。我这是夸你呢！"
    mc_1 "Haha, you're mad at me, aren't you? (Thinks of something) It's a term of endearment."
    mc_1 "Girls in Xiliang only address guys we find special by something like this."

# game/script.rpy:378
translate english a_4_3_e67291b4:

    # "或许是他真的信以为真了，顿时耳根都红的快要滴血了，手也抓紧了自己的衣角。难道是小傻子害羞了？"
    "Perhaps he actually believed in what I said. Not only he looks flustered, but also every inch of his cheeks and ears are soaked in red hues. Is he getting shy?"

# game/script.rpy:380
translate english a_4_3_b61ed476:

    # six "（喃喃自语）也是，你我只是初识，可姑娘却待我胜于好友。"
    six "(Mutters) Right, it's our first encounter but you treat me like a friend."

# game/script.rpy:381
translate english a_4_3_ad2bbc2b:

    # mc_1 "你这次出来是做什么啊？"
    mc_1 "So why are you here?"

# game/script.rpy:382
translate english a_4_3_19027886:

    # six "我来找师父。之前家中有一个宴会，可他老人家去了南海，所以没有收到贺礼。我想亲手带给他。"
    six "I'm here to find my grandmaster and mentor. There was a family banquet that he didn't attend, and I think he's off to the South China Sea. I want to bring him a present."

# game/script.rpy:383
translate english a_4_3_16b03559:

    # mc_1 "你的师父是谁啊？"
    mc_1 "Who's your grandmaster?"

# game/script.rpy:384
translate english a_4_3_01fed650:

    # six "(放下筷子，一本正经)师尊乃是太上老君。"
    six "(Puts down his chopsticks, all serious) My grandmaster is the revered one - The Grand Supreme Elderly Lord, Lao-tzu."

# game/script.rpy:385
translate english a_4_3_961f23e8:

    # mc_1 "（被他突如其来的回答逗笑，连连拍手）难怪你穿的这么像道家的衣服！果真是得了老君的真传。"
    mc_1 "(Laughs so hard that I start to clap my hands) No wonder why you dress so much like a Daoist. Lao-tzu is the founder of Daoism and also a deity."

# game/script.rpy:386
translate english a_4_3_a9ef119b:

    # six "姑娘是否不信？我只要掐指一算便知道你的名字和身份。"
    six "Lady, do you not believe me? I also can forecast the future and gain insight to the past and present."

# game/script.rpy:387
translate english a_4_3_778b03a6:

    # mc_1 "（稍有兴趣）哦？ 不然你试试？"
    mc_1 "(Seemingly interested) Oh really? Why don't you give it a try?"

# game/script.rpy:389
translate english a_4_3_f2ab0381:

    # six "（掐指一算，沉思片刻）你叫做慕容凌，生来就是西凉国的公主。就连你的名字都是因为国师透过占卜算来的。"
    six "(Calculating something with his fingers) Your name is Ling Murong, the princess of Xiliang. The prime minister gave you the name after reading your sign."

# game/script.rpy:390
translate english a_4_3_362fd49f:

    # "心里一惊，难道这个少年真的有什么神通？我想到有些官宦子弟会去城隍庙或者观音庙去拜神仙为干爹或者干娘，或许这小傻子也是这样？"
    "How did he know about my identity? Does he actually know sorcery?"
    "I know some aristocrats would donate a large amount of money to earn god's favor, and in exchange, see deities as their parents or family members."
    "Maybe Liu Lang is just like one of them?"

# game/script.rpy:391
translate english a_4_3_82f27ed4:

    # six "（有些得意）看吧，这些普通的算卦我还是知晓的。"
    six "(Grins) See, I know basic fortune telling."

# game/script.rpy:392
translate english a_4_3_2d677f2c:

    # "他冲着我笑了笑，接着用筷子给我添了菜。身为公主，其实我一般都是自己用膳。他这个举动有让我的心暖了些。"
    "He presses his lips to give a smile, then passes some dishes to my bowl. As a princess, I usually eat by myself. His gesture makes me feel I'm being cared for."

# game/script.rpy:393
translate english a_4_3_3a88cca9:

    # "为了避免他看到我的神情，于是我拿出了药膏轻轻地涂在了他白皙清丽的脸颊上。当他的双眸看向我时，我觉得指尖微微发烫。"
    "To avoid his eyes, I take out an ointment and paste some on his pale cheeks. When his eyes meet my own, I feel as if my fingertips are burning."

# game/script.rpy:394
translate english a_4_3_826298d1:

    # "神奇的是，他的伤口慢慢愈合着。他的目光未曾从我的脸上移开，而一只手也轻轻的握住了我的手腕。这傻小子怎么有点俊俏啊？"
    "The next scene is almost unbelievable. His wounds slowly heal in the next few minutes."
    "He never removes his eyes from me, and to get my attention, his hand gently grasps my wrist. Oh, I think he is quite handsome."

# game/script.rpy:396
translate english a_4_3_1762dfe1:

    # boy "（看到这一幕）六郎，你怎么在这？你在做什么？"
    boy "(Looks at us) Liu Lang, why are you here? And what in the world are you doing?"

# game/script.rpy:398
translate english a_4_3_d4a9bb09:

    # six "（赶快松开手）五哥，我。。。我是来凡间找师尊的。"
    six "(Let go of his hand) Fifth brother, I… I am here to find my grandmaster."

# game/script.rpy:400
translate english a_4_3_6cd04b29:

    # boy "哼！找师父？你怎么不去南海啊？"
    boy "Humph! Blatant lies. Then why don't you visit the South China Sea?"

# game/script.rpy:401
translate english a_4_3_7ef85e96:

    # boy "怎么找到人家姑娘家的手腕上了！"
    boy "Why did you grab a girl's wrist?"

# game/script.rpy:403
translate english a_4_3_e1452216:

    # "还没等六郎回复这个男子，刚刚那位姑娘又来到了我们桌前。"
    "Before Liu Lang responds to the youth, the girl from earlier comes to our table."

# game/script.rpy:404
translate english a_4_3_31c56f30:

    # girl_2 "（掐住少年的耳朵）原来你在这儿偷懒啊，还不赶紧去厨房做菜？"
    girl_2 "(Pinches his ear) What a lazybone. Your job is to make food. Why don't you go back to the kitchen?"

# game/script.rpy:406
translate english a_4_3_769591d0:

    # boy "（挣脱着少女掐着他的手）好姐姐，这个是我亲弟弟。他这回带姑娘出来吃东西，我这个做哥哥的一定要过问一下啊。"
    boy "(Break free from her hand) Come on, sis. He is my brother by blood. I've never seen him with a girl before, so I gotta ask him more questions."

# game/script.rpy:408
translate english a_4_3_58d8e8f2:

    # girl_2 "（拽着少年进厨房）先做生意，后谈感情。 其他客官可都等着你煮菜呢！而且好不容易弟弟和漂亮姑娘吃饭，你瞎凑什么劲啊？"
    girl_2 "(Drags him to the kitchen) Well, business before relationships. All of our customers are waiting for you to make more food."
    girl_2 "And if your brother gets to dine out with a pretty girl, why should you interfere?"

# game/script.rpy:409
translate english a_4_3_9a1f72de:

    # girl_2 "有些做哥哥的自己单身就想弟弟也得单着。你这个小恶魔还不去做饭！"
    girl_2 "Brothers like you can be really evil huh. Just because you're single, you want your younger siblings to be single too. Why don't you go and make more food, little devil?"

# game/script.rpy:410
translate english a_4_3_adc72183:

    # "原来六郎的哥哥是个厨子，而且待遇也不好。看来家中一定很穷苦吧。"
    "“Liu Lang's brother is a chef, but they don't treat him well. Maybe his family is from the working class."

# game/script.rpy:412
translate english a_4_3_c6d91b94:

    # "这时，一个清秀的少年端着茶水向我们走来。见到六郎时，他先是有些诧异，但还是保持了微笑。"
    "Another good-looking youth comes to our direction, with tea and cups in his hand. When he sees Liu Lang, his expression changes a bit, but soon returns a smile."

# game/script.rpy:413
translate english a_4_3_f87fb1ac:

    # boy "（放下茶具，对着六郎说道）你来倒茶，还是我来倒啊？"
    boy "(Puts down teacup sets, speaks to Liu Lang) Would you like to be served?"

# game/script.rpy:415
translate english a_4_3_b65686fb:

    # six "四哥，你也在这？！怎可劳烦四哥，自然是我来倒。"
    six "Oh, fourth brother, you're here too?! It would be against customs to be served by an older brother. I'll help myself."

# game/script.rpy:416
translate english a_4_3_c05f4deb:

    # girl_2 "（吃着鸡腿）又来了一个哥哥？！"
    girl_2 "(Eating a chicken drumstick) Another brother?!"

# game/script.rpy:418
translate english a_4_3_e2c2b8d3:

    # boy "(温柔)还请姑娘照顾好我六弟。"
    boy "(Kindly) Lady, please take care of my sixth brother."

# game/script.rpy:419
translate english a_4_3_b81e705c:

    # boy "（看向他）找到师父之后就早日回家。可别在外逗留。（意味深长的说）若是在外惹事，兄长也不能保你。"
    boy "(Looks at him) You should return home once you find your mentor. Staying in this realm can be very dangerous. If you get into trouble, I will not be able to save you."

# game/script.rpy:421
translate english a_4_3_8cfeb9a1:

    # girl_2 "那桌的客官迟迟叫不到人，兴许你也是和自家弟弟聊上了。还不快去添些茶水?人家要的是乌龙茶，可别加错了。"
    girl_2 "That table over there couldn't get anyone to help them. I guess you're also in the middle of a conversation with your younger brother. "
    girl_2 "Why don't you add tea to the table over there? They want oolong tea, not something else."

# game/script.rpy:423
translate english a_4_3_78018910:

    # boy "（无奈的笑了笑）真是拿你没办法。"
    boy "(Smiles reluctantly) It's not like I have another choice besides listening to you."

# game/script.rpy:424
translate english a_4_3_1c9df4d8:

    # "一个哥哥当厨子，一个是跑堂的。若我不去管这个六郎，说不定他也来这酒楼当算账的了。。。"
    "If one of Liu Lang's brother is a chef, and the other a waiter, then there's a high chance that he'll be a cashier had I not helped him."

# game/script.rpy:426
translate english a_4_3_95836e6c:

    # mc_1 "（同情的看着六郎）放心，若是你跟着我回宫，本公主一定不会让你饿肚子的。"
    mc_1 "(Sympathizing) Don't worry about it. If you are willing to come with me to the imperial palace, I will never let you starve for a day."

# game/script.rpy:427
translate english a_4_3_2fd169fd:

    # boy "？？？？"
    boy "？？？？"

# game/script.rpy:428
translate english a_4_3_292519e3:

    # mc_1 "话说回来，你的哥哥们看起来一个个都是玉树临风的美少年。这倒是不错嘛。"
    mc_1 "Actually, it's pretty awesome that your brothers are all quite handsome and attractive. I'm so jealous haha."

# game/script.rpy:429
translate english a_4_3_60e68850:

    # "他又再次放下筷子，空气里有一股酸味。我笑着和他说自己要先出去走走，而他可在这里等着机会去和自己的哥哥们交谈。"
    "He puts down his chopsticks again, and I can smell jealousy in the air. Teasing him, I decide to go out for some fresh air, so he can have some time to catch up with his brothers."

# game/script.rpy:430
translate english a_4_3_aaa69346:

    # six "你是不是觉得若是自己是店家的女儿就好了？这样就能看见我的四哥和五哥了"
    six "Do you wish that you're the daughter of this restaurant? If so, you'll get to see my fourth and fifth brother a lot."

# game/script.rpy:433
translate english a_4_3_c63b7caf:

    # six "（离开位子，去了厨房）哼，真是不可理喻。我不理你了。"
    six "(Leaves his seat, heads to the kitchen) Humph, we can't have a conversation. I'm not talking to you. "

# game/script.rpy:436
translate english a_4_3_2c7fd437:

    # mc_1 "哪有啊，这四郎和五郎哪有我们家六郎好？"
    mc_1 "Of course not. You are so much more lovable than your fourth and fifth brothers."

# game/script.rpy:437
translate english a_4_3_378a32ce:

    # six "（脸红的像柿子）我哪有你说的那么好。"
    six "(Red tomato cheeks) Oh, am I really that lovable? You flatter me, princess."

# game/script.rpy:438
translate english a_4_3_72d0f715:

    # mc_1 "好啦，你现在这吃着，等我回来。和哥哥们聊一聊，我很快就回来了。"
    mc_1 "Of course you are. Just stay here and wait for me to return. Talk to your brothers if you haven't seen them for a long time. I will be back soon."

# game/script.rpy:444
translate english a_4_4_2962d1f6:

    # "刚出店口没多久，我就以尝试的心情打开了二郎给我的纸条。慢声慢语的读完了诗句。灯火阑珊处是指哪里？"
    "As I step out of the restaurant, I decide to open the note that Er Lang gifted me. Enunciating every word, the poem flows really smoothly. "
    "\"I find him there where lantern light is dimly shed. \" Where will he be?"

# game/script.rpy:447
translate english a_4_4_f95950de:

    # "我没有遇到二郎，难道是选错了？回去再选一次吧。"
    "I didn't meet him. I must have chosen the wrong thing. Go back and choose again."

# game/script.rpy:451
translate english a_4_4_5de262c6:

    # "在灯火零稀的地方，我看到了一个戴面具的少年。他身高八尺，仪表堂堂。不仅他的身姿挺拔，而且身上还散发出了草药的香气。"
    "Under the flickering dim light, I see a youth with a blue mask. He's probably six ft something, quite stunning. "
    "He has the smell of herbs and a fresh scent of the earth after a rainy day"

# game/script.rpy:455
translate english a_4_5_dab6f613:

    # two "（卸下面具）好巧啊，怎么突然唤小生出来了？"
    two "(Takes off his mask) So you've found me here. Is there something I can help you with?"

# game/script.rpy:456
translate english a_4_5_a54902b5:

    # mc_1 "二郎真的没有骗我！咦？你在哪里买的面具啊？我也想要一个！"
    mc_1 "Oh, you actually were saying the truth. Where did you get a mask? I want one too!"

# game/script.rpy:457
translate english a_4_5_27d3aebd:

    # two "一言既出驷马难追，怎会骗你？不是买的，这个（摇摆着蓝色的怪人面具，津津乐道）是赢来的。"
    two "Of course, a real man always stays truthful to his words. I didn't buy this mask. I won it. (Shows off his mask, grins)"

# game/script.rpy:458
translate english a_4_5_67d99a56:

    # mc_1 "赢来的？此话怎讲？"
    mc_1 "How did you win this mask?"

# game/script.rpy:460
translate english a_4_5_f7bacac5:

    # two "还不是因为东街那儿比赛射箭，若是能中红心靶子，那么就能赢得面具。"
    two "There's an archery competition on the other side of the street. As long as you can hit the bull's eye, then you can win a mask."

# game/script.rpy:461
translate english a_4_5_8f9b2da3:

    # mc_1 "（有些惊喜）还有这事！走，我们去看看。"
    mc_1 "(Thrilled) Oh, that's so cool. Let's go check it out."

# game/script.rpy:464
translate english a_4_5_2edcbb5d:

    # "没想到原来这里的射箭手都必须带上黑布。有时冷风刮的大，我都有些担心要是箭偏了，射伤了百姓该当如何。"
    "I didn't know it's a rule to blindfold all the archers. Sometimes when the wind blows harder, I'm afraid the arrows will hurt some pedestrians."

# game/script.rpy:465
translate english a_4_5_5f8b9169:

    # "二郎却自信满满的系上了黑布，举止间，他有着书籍里那些意气风发，少年将军的气度。他身上又有我在其他少年里找不到的独特气质。"
    "Confident, Er Lang wraps a piece of black cloth around his head, covering his eyes. He reminds me of those brave and graceful commanders in wars. "
    "There's something about him that's so different from the other guys."

# game/script.rpy:467
translate english a_4_5_9f0f77da:

    # "二郎轻巧地拿起弓箭，身体微微倾斜，以熟悉的角度瞄准了箭靶。"
    "He gracefully holds his bow, tilting his body, finding a familiar angle to unleash those arrows."

# game/script.rpy:468
translate english a_4_5_4702df81:

    # "他修长的手指划在弓上，接着强而有力度地放出了箭 。"
    "His slender fingers brush over the bow, then swift fires his arrows."

# game/script.rpy:469
translate english a_4_5_67654900:

    # "好像他早已预料出了箭会直中红心，一副镇定的样子，就好像把一切都泰然处之了。 难道说他真能百步穿杨不成？"
    "It's as if he knows where they will eventually land, Er Lang maintains his composure while looking very confident. Is he an experienced marksman?"

# game/script.rpy:471
translate english a_4_5_313eb8bf:

    # mc_1 "（开心的跳了起来）二郎，我们射到红心啦！"
    mc_1 "(Excited) Bull's eye! We did it, Er Lang."

# game/script.rpy:472
translate english a_4_5_7ffa5112:

    # two "这回只是牛刀小试罢了。在我的兄弟之中，弓箭之术乃是我的强项。"
    two "It's expected haha. Amongst all of my brothers, archery is my area of expertise."

# game/script.rpy:473
translate english a_4_5_7694a1c7:

    # mc_1 "（不经意挽住他的手臂）你看，这就是我们赢的面具！"
    mc_1 "(Wraps my hand around his arm) Look, this is the mask we won!"

# game/script.rpy:475
translate english a_4_5_ab3af10b:

    # two "若是你喜欢就好。嗯，看起来倒是挺可爱的。"
    two "As long as you like it, it's always yours to keep. Hmm, very cute, huh?"

# game/script.rpy:476
translate english a_4_5_f2fb7cbf:

    # mc_1 "（笑的甜滋滋的）我也好喜欢！这个面具我第一眼就相中了，幸好别人没有拿走。"
    mc_1 "(Smiles) I like it very much! It's one of the first things I set my eyes on. I'm glad no one has taken it away."

# game/script.rpy:477
translate english a_4_5_757aa080:

    # two "你怎么知道我是在夸面具而不是戴面具的那位佳人？"
    two "How would you know that I'm complimenting the mask, not the person who's wearing it?"

# game/script.rpy:478
translate english a_4_5_c13c9b28:

    # "听到这个，我的心好似小鹿乱撞了一番。甚至有些不知道该回答什么才好。"
    "A new emotion occupies my heart, and for a second, I feel like I've lost the ability to speak."

# game/script.rpy:479
translate english a_4_5_a5ca7c12:

    # two "上次未曾请教姑娘芳名？"
    two "I haven't asked your name yet. Would you be so kind to let me know your name, lady?"

# game/script.rpy:481
translate english a_4_5_d3e41682:

    # mc_1 "我叫阿凌。"
    mc_1 "You can call me Ah-Ling"

# game/script.rpy:483
translate english a_4_5_19c9c52a:

    # two "好，阿凌。天色不早了，你要早些回家。"
    two "Sure, ah-ling. You should return home before it's too late. It's getting dark."

# game/script.rpy:484
translate english a_4_5_df564411:

    # mc_1 "下一次还能见到你吗？"
    mc_1 "Will I be able to see you again?"

# game/script.rpy:485
translate english a_4_5_15f0a0f9:

    # two "说不定吧。"
    two "Probably"

# game/script.rpy:487
translate english a_4_5_8d38deb8:

    # "就这样，我道别了二郎，漫步走回了永安酒楼。"
    "As we finished our conversation, I said good-bye and returned to the Yong-An restaurant."

# game/script.rpy:488
translate english a_4_5_d0128e75:

    # "回想起今晚，哪位郎君让我最留恋？"
    "Recalling all the bits and pieces tonight, which guy makes my heart skip a beat"

# game/script.rpy:499
translate english a_4_6_48de9342:

    # "第二天早晨，闲来无事，我就找宫里的婢女和宦官一起玩捉迷藏。"
    "The next morning, I decided to play hide and seek with my servants in the imperial palace."

# game/script.rpy:500
translate english a_4_6_39f44fc4:

    # "大家玩的正开心，可是我过了好久都没有抓住人。心里有些急 。我正好蒙着眼，专心听着好几个熟悉的宫女声音。"
    "We're all having a blast, yet I still haven't caught anyone. Losing my patience, I listen carefully at the sound of their voices and footsteps. "

# game/script.rpy:501
translate english a_4_6_628e3c0f:

    # "心里一喜，我赶紧上前，抓住了前面的人。"
    "Delighted, I move forward to catch the person in front of me."

# game/script.rpy:502
translate english a_4_6_c101df92:

    # "取下纱布，我希望看到的人是"
    "Who do I wish him to be?"

# game/script.rpy:512
translate english a_4_7_7da2cb95:

    # "顿时，宫人嬉笑的声音赫然全无。我好奇地摘下眼罩才发现眼前的人就是令人闻风丧胆的国师大人。"
    "All of a sudden, everyone becomes silent. Curious, I take off my blindfold to meet their eyes. It's the prime minister, the most feared man in the court."

# game/script.rpy:514
translate english a_4_7_cea845b8:

    # npc1 "公主今天倒是挺有兴致的，昨晚在外玩的一定是尽兴了。"
    npc1 "Your grace, you seem to be happier than ever. I bet you had a lot of fun sneaking out last night."

# game/script.rpy:515
translate english a_4_7_cce17f3f:

    # "说来奇怪，国师大人从我出生起就没有变过面容。即使是我的父皇已经从黑发变成银发，可是国师却像吃了长生不老药一般，青春永驻。"
    "The most strange thing about the prime minister is that he never really aged. "
    "Although my father the emperor has aged as his hair turned from black to silver, the prime minister remained youthful."

# game/script.rpy:517
translate english a_4_7_5577e0eb:

    # mc_1 "这西凉如此之大，怎么本宫想出去一趟都要你来管？国师天天祭祀繁忙，本宫的事情你少管。"
    mc_1 "Prime minister, you should be busy helping my father. Stop minding my business."

# game/script.rpy:519
translate english a_4_7_da8d7279:

    # npc1 "公主想出去，大可告知微臣。我也好命令下去，让人护你周全。何必偷偷跑出去？"
    npc1 "If you really want to go out, you could have informed me. I'd make orders and send people to protect you."

# game/script.rpy:520
translate english a_4_7_11ae8083:

    # mc_1 "我才不要这些废物保护我，他们只会像看守犯人一样跟着本宫。一点都不好玩！"
    mc_1 "I don't need anyone to protect me. I know martial arts. They always follow me everywhere as if I'm a criminal. It's not fun at all!"

# game/script.rpy:521
translate english a_4_7_45270ccb:

    # npc1 "即使如此，公主的安危还是排在第一。如今你也是姑娘家了，怎么只想着玩？这心性还得收一收。"
    npc1 "But your safety should be our priority. You're not a little girl anymore, why do you keep thinking about what's fun and what's not?"

# game/script.rpy:523
translate english a_4_7_a7d8ea8c:

    # mc_1 "本宫只是一个凡人，不像国师大人有着不老之身。 人生苦短，若是不随心所欲，那多没意思。"
    mc_1 "I am just a normal person, unlike you, prime minister, who has drank from the fountain of youth. Life is too short to not celebrate anything that makes us happy."

# game/script.rpy:525
translate english a_4_7_14473a6c:

    # npc1 "长生不老又有何难？若是公主想，微臣以练好丹药，只要每日一粒，尽可长寿。"
    npc1 "Immortality isn't that hard. If your grace wants to maintain your youth, then I can make a new potion."

# game/script.rpy:526
translate english a_4_7_360fc1bf:

    # mc_1 "我才不吃那些什么丹药。谁知道你在里面放了什么？"
    mc_1 "I'm not gonna drink anything from you. Who knows what you did to your potions?"

# game/script.rpy:528
translate english a_4_7_c1dccd4b:

    # girl_1 "（试着圆场）国师大人也是好意，只是公主从小体质柔弱。多对药物敏感还是下次再收国师的美意吧。"
    girl_1 "(Interrupts us) The prime minister is just being kind. But our princess can be allergic to some potions. Maybe we should be more cautious about it."

# game/script.rpy:529
translate english a_4_7_c1546b5b:

    # "阿轩陪伴我多年，在这深宫中早已见过各种形形色色的人。她对事情的拿捏还是比较谨慎的，所以我也比较喜欢她的性情。"
    "Ah-Xuan has been with me since the very beginning. She knows how to take matters seriously and how to properly respond to officials. She's worthy of my affection."

# game/script.rpy:531
translate english a_4_7_d7ea2d2a:

    # npc1 "也罢。可是我听人说，你从宫外带回来了一个人？而且还是个男人？"
    npc1 "Alright, but I've heard from someone saying that you've brought a man to the palace? He's quite young but still a man."

# game/script.rpy:532
translate english a_4_7_681c633c:

    # "突然想起来，昨晚我带了六郎回到了皇宫里。现在还在偏殿里打坐呢！"
    "Oh, he's referring to Liu Lang, who's still meditating in the lower court."

# game/script.rpy:534
translate english a_4_7_4088727f:

    # mc_1 "（宫人们有些吃惊，个个用另类的眼光看着我）什么男人啊？他才不是男人！"
    mc_1 "(Everyone is astonished, looking at me with disapproval) What man are you talking about? He's not a man!"

# game/script.rpy:535
translate english a_4_7_525d0890:

    # npc1 "哦？那他是谁？"
    npc1 "Then who is he?"

# game/script.rpy:537
translate english a_4_7_1bab1041:

    # girl_1 "回禀国师，此人是公主府的小太监。常年都在宫外的公主府办事，所以难免宫里的人不认识。他的户籍早就安置在公主府多年，婢子可拿给您"
    girl_1 "Prime minister, he's a eunuch. He usually lives outside the palace, running errands for the princess, so not everyone has seen him before. "
    girl_1 "His birth certificates and contracts are somewhere in the princess's manor. Would you like to view them?"

# game/script.rpy:538
translate english a_4_7_f1756ba5:

    # npc1 "（摆摆手）算了，原来只是一个小太监。既然是这样，微臣就先行告退了"
    npc1 "(Waves his hand to indicate a no) Nevermind, just a eunuch. If that's the case, I shall leave and take care of some business in the court."

# game/script.rpy:539
translate english a_4_7_284d0d7e:

    # mc_1 "（看着国师走远了，把阿轩拉到一边）刚才多亏有你，看来你的反应倒是挺快嘛。现在你都是首席宫女了，我要怎么奖赏你呀？"
    mc_1 "(As he prime minister walks away, I pull Ah-Xuan aside) You're such a life-saver. You can think on your feet, huh? How should I thank you? You're already the top lady assistant."

# game/script.rpy:540
translate english a_4_7_5aed0b1b:

    # girl_1 "好啦，公主。刚才简直吓死我了!要不是昨晚我去了公主府把一切安排妥当，还真不知今儿个会出什么乱子。"
    girl_1 "Princess, you shouldn't just play around anymore. I was so afraid of the prime minister. If I didn't plan everything out last night, who knows what may have happened?"

# game/script.rpy:542
translate english a_4_7_364904bb:

    # mc_1 "好阿轩，若不是有你在我身边，本宫还真不知该怎么办。以后本宫要封你做郡主，让你也有人伺候着。"
    mc_1 "Ah-Xuan, you're my best friend and know how to manage all the matters. I want to elevate your status one day, so people can treat you like a noblewoman too."

# game/script.rpy:543
translate english a_4_7_93582bd1:

    # girl_1 "嗯，那就等公主封我为郡主的那一天了。现在啊，我看有大事要发生了"
    girl_1 "Your Grace, I will wait for the day to come. But as of now, something major is gonna happen."

# game/script.rpy:544
translate english a_4_7_9347150d:

    # mc_1 "什么事啊？"
    mc_1 "What are you talking about?"

# game/script.rpy:545
translate english a_4_7_e1151333:

    # girl_1 "婢子今天在正殿外听到陛下和国师的谈话了。"
    girl_1 "I heard a private conversation between the emperor and his prime minister."

# game/script.rpy:546
translate english a_4_7_837ab2eb:

    # mc_1 "父皇和国师谈话又不是第一次了，这有什么？"
    mc_1 "His Majesty always holds private conversations with the prime minister. What's special about it?"

# game/script.rpy:548
translate english a_4_7_9dca03d2:

    # girl_1 "不是的，公主。婢子听到国师说他想要娶你为妻！"
    girl_1 "No, your grace. I heard the prime minister saying that he wanted you as a wife."

# game/script.rpy:549
translate english a_4_7_6366c020:

    # mc_1 "（吃惊）什么？！父皇怎么说？！！"
    mc_1 "(Astonished) What?! What did his majesty say?"

# game/script.rpy:550
translate english a_4_7_f7d293b9:

    # girl_1 "嘘，小声点。说来奇怪，殿下对国师一直是百依百顺的，二十几年来未变。可是唯独这件事，陛下说必须要公主自己答应才好。"
    girl_1 "Lower your voice, princess. Although the emperor is usually obedient to the prime minister, he didn't approve of this marriage. He wants to get your consent."

# game/script.rpy:552
translate english a_4_7_c1b460f8:

    # mc_1 "吓死本公主了！这国师好歹也几千岁了吧。他这些年都未曾娶妻，这回竟然打起了本宫的主意。哼，看我以后怎么收拾他！"
    mc_1 "What the… The prime minister is probably a thousand years old. He never had a wife before, so why does he want to marry me now? "
    mc_1 "That's so creepy, I won't give him a good attitude"

# game/script.rpy:553
translate english a_4_7_38790143:

    # girl_1 "其实国师大人也是风度翩翩，看起来也才二十几岁的样子。而且神通广大，对公主也是挺上心的。"
    girl_1 "The prime minister is not so bad. He looks about twenty-something, great in sorcery, and quite handsome too. He seems to care about you."

# game/script.rpy:554
translate english a_4_7_85535a64:

    # mc_1 "可是他尽是做一些伤天害理的祭祀之事，满手血腥。我才不喜欢他呢！"
    mc_1 "He's got blood all over his hands. Human sacrifices and dark magic. I don't like him at all."

# game/script.rpy:555
translate english a_4_7_1bfbbe32:

    # mc_1 "最近还有何事要禀告？"
    mc_1 "Anything else that you want to talk about?"

# game/script.rpy:557
translate english a_4_7_fd421082:

    # girl_1 "今早国师从宫外带回来了一位姑娘。她看起来和我们早些日遇见的那个有龙尾的渔女有些相似！"
    girl_1 "The prime minister has brought a girl to the imperial palace since the morning. She looks like the girl that we met on the shore."

# game/script.rpy:558
translate english a_4_7_87b61311:

    # mc_1 "还有这事？我看甚是古怪，走，我们去看看这国师卖的是什么药。"
    mc_1 "Oh really? Something isn't right. Let's see what's going on."

# game/script.rpy:560
translate english a_4_7_cfabd413:

    # "接着，我和阿轩就来到了国师的书房。竟然发现房间里正有一女。她有着绝色之貌，手里拿着一本书，桌上堆满了古老的法术秘籍。"
    "Next, we come to the prime minister's library. There's a girl at the center of the room. She's extremely beautiful, and there's a lot of books stacked up on the table. "

# game/script.rpy:561
translate english a_4_7_ffb52f14:

    # girl_2 "你们是谁？是来送我点心的吗？"
    girl_2 "Who are you? Are you the ones who are supposed to bring me snacks?"

# game/script.rpy:562
translate english a_4_7_e13107d7:

    # girl_1 "若是姑娘想要点心，婢子可去取一些上好的糕点。"
    girl_1 "Lady, if you want snacks, then I shall fetch some for you."

# game/script.rpy:564
translate english a_4_7_087ce1cc:

    # mc_1 "本宫乃是西凉公主，你又是何人？"
    mc_1 "I am the princess of Xiliang, who are you?"

# game/script.rpy:566
translate english a_4_7_7325ced6:

    # girl_2 "（对我的身份没有什么惊奇）哦。你们也是来这里读书的？"
    girl_2 "(Not impressed about my identity) Oh, are you here to study?"

# game/script.rpy:567
translate english a_4_7_d6511196:

    # mc_1 "你在读什么书？"
    mc_1 "What are you reading?"

# game/script.rpy:569
translate english a_4_7_4bee8210:

    # girl_2 "（打了哈切）都是一些仙术秘籍。我手上这本就是龙宫的高级仙术秘诀。不知道这个哥哥是怎么搜集到这么多秘籍的。"
    girl_2 "(Sighs) Just some sorcery stuff. This book here is all about high level magic from the dragon palace. I'm not sure how he's able to get so many books."

# game/script.rpy:571
translate english a_4_7_b0a3341a:

    # mc_1 "难道说他自己不明白其中道理，所以想让你来帮他？"
    mc_1 "Is it because he doesn't understand how to interpret certain passages from the book? He wants to seek help from you?"

# game/script.rpy:572
translate english a_4_7_37e8ccb6:

    # girl_2 "或许吧。他的仙术还好，但是妖术在三界之中一定是顶级的。 我看就连八仙都不是他的对手。"
    girl_2 "Perhaps yes. He's proficient in white magic, but his dark magic is one of the best in the world. Even the Eight Immortals can't win a fight against him."

# game/script.rpy:573
translate english a_4_7_3adde089:

    # mc_1 "你为何愿意帮他？"
    mc_1 "Why are you willing to help him?"

# game/script.rpy:575
translate english a_4_7_baf0708a:

    # girl_2 "早些年他来过我家做客。只是好些年没见面了。今日他愿意带我出海，所以我就入宫了。只是没想到来人间还要读书，这还不如在龙宫里呢。"
    girl_2 "He used to be a guest in my family. We haven't seen each other for a long time. He's willing to bring me out of the ocean, so I agree to come to the palace. "
    girl_2 "But I didn't know I had to stay here and read books. Had I known, I'd rather stay in the dragon palace."

# game/script.rpy:576
translate english a_4_7_fd316755:

    # mc_1 "龙宫里？"
    mc_1 "The dragon palace?"

# game/script.rpy:577
translate english a_4_7_6dbd0d32:

    # girl_2 "（捂住嘴巴）没，没什么！"
    girl_2 "(Covers her mouth) Oh, no. I didn't say anything."

# game/script.rpy:579
translate english a_4_7_bb91736e:

    # mc_1 "（走进了些）你别怕，本宫在这宫里什么没见过啊。你要是知晓仙术，想必也是仙人。这就不用瞒我了。只是这些书籍枯燥，不如我带你去玩"
    mc_1 "(Walks closer to her) Don't be afraid. I've seen a lot of strange things lately. If you know sorcery and magic, you're probably a celestial being. "
    mc_1 " You don't need to cover up anything. Reading books can be really exhausting, why don't we go out instead?"

# game/script.rpy:581
translate english a_4_7_fdac6011:

    # girl_2 "（立马放下书籍）原来你都知道了啊。瞧我怕的。哥哥说凡人不能知晓我们的身份，既然你都知道了。那也没什么，我们去哪里玩啊？"
    girl_2 "(Immediately put the books away) Oh so you know. I didn't need to be so afraid haha. "
    girl_2 "My brothers said I should never reveal my identity to mortals, but since you already know, it shouldn't be a problem. Where are we going?"

# game/script.rpy:582
translate english a_4_7_a97911fb:

    # mc_1 "嘻嘻，待我换好装，我们一起去吃糖人吧！"
    mc_1 "Haha, give me a moment to change. We should get candies at the vendor's."

# game/script.rpy:585
translate english a_4_7_4be1e903:

    # "我们离开了皇宫，先是去了上次卖糖人的那个小摊子。店主看到我一下就认出来了。"
    "We leave the palace as soon as we can. We first visit the vendor's, and the owner soon recognizes me."

# game/script.rpy:587
translate english a_4_7_59cfc533:

    # mc_1 "我今日带了朋友一起来买糖人。 咦？（看到上次二郎拿的糖人）这位妹妹， 你可知道这个糖人是什么？"
    mc_1 "Hey there, I brought a friend this time. (recognize the same candy from last time, turn to the girl)  Do you happen to know what this is?"

# game/script.rpy:588
translate english a_4_7_1994ecbe:

    # girl_2 "自然知道。（低头一笑，眼中尽是柔情）此乃鲲鹏。"
    girl_2 "Of course I do. (Shyly lowers her eyes, full of affection) It's the legendary bird, Roc."

# game/script.rpy:589
translate english a_4_7_f03a75c4:

    # "啊？看来世人皆知此物是鲲鹏。。。"
    "Oh, so everyone knows what it is."

# game/script.rpy:590
translate english a_4_7_f11f0162:

    # mc_1 "不错嘛，这都知道！"
    mc_1 "Good job, I just want to check in with you, haha."

# game/script.rpy:591
translate english a_4_7_7d1da02d:

    # dude5 "姑娘，上次陪你来的那位郎君怎么不见他来？"
    dude5 "Lady, where is the gentleman that came with you last time?"

# game/script.rpy:592
translate english a_4_7_a36d39ab:

    # mc_1 "我和他只有几面之缘，这怎么说？"
    mc_1 "He's merely an acquaintance, why do you ask?"

# game/script.rpy:593
translate english a_4_7_e58f029b:

    # dude5 "恕老夫多话，昨夜我见你们一起走在东街，两人手中都拿着面具。老夫还以为你们是金童玉女下凡呢。"
    dude5 "Oh my bad. When I saw you guys walking down the street last night, both with a mask in hand, I mistook you guys as celestial beings."

# game/script.rpy:594
translate english a_4_7_82c51a81:

    # girl_2 "原来姐姐有喜欢的人啊？"
    girl_2 "Oh, sis, do you have a crush on that guy?"

# game/script.rpy:597
translate english a_4_7_92f0d303:

    # mc_1 "（想到二郎的笑颜，我点了点头）嗯，他是一个温柔的郎君呢。"
    mc_1 "(Thought about Er Lang's smiles) Yeah, he's a kind and sweet guy."

# game/script.rpy:600
translate english a_4_7_8c5569fb:

    # mc_1 "（尴尬一笑）不算吧，就是偶遇的某个郎君罢了。"
    mc_1 "(Embarrassed) Not really, just a random guy that I met last night."

# game/script.rpy:604
translate english a_4_8_06848774:

    # f1 "是吗？我在家中是第九个女儿，大家都叫我九妹。从小我就和一个远方亲戚的儿子定了亲。他也是个温柔的哥哥呢！除了小时候见过他"
    f1 "Oh really? I am the ninth daughter in my family. People usually call me Jiumei. Ever since I was a child, I have been engaged with son of a relative."


# game/script.rpy:605
translate english a_4_8_23137215:

    # girl_2 "我只有昨晚稍微见了他一面。他还是和儿时一样，温文尔雅。对我也是彬彬有礼，只是我担心他还是把我当成小妹来看待。"
    girl_2 "He's also a kind and sweet guy. I've only seen him in my younger years. But he visited my family last night. I'm afraid that he only sees me as a younger sister."

# game/script.rpy:606
translate english a_4_8_2a6ac759:

    # "我是怎么看待爱情的？"
    "What's my take on love?"

# game/script.rpy:609
translate english a_4_8_afd417e7:

    # mc_1 "感情之事必定要自己争取才能有所成果。若是不拼力一试，怎会知道结果如何？"
    mc_1 "I think we should always be proactive in everything, including love. If I don't fight for love, then how should I know who I'm gonna end up with?"

# game/script.rpy:612
translate english a_4_8_1006447b:

    # mc_1 "感情之事本该是两情相悦。世上之事都有缘起缘落，若是感情到了，自然会水到渠成。"
    mc_1 "Love should be mutual. Everything has a beginning, middle, and end. If we wait for it to happen, then we'll eventually find someone that loves us the most."

# game/script.rpy:615
translate english a_4_9_88c41926:

    # f1 "姐姐虽是血肉之躯，可是明白的道理确实比我多。嗯，我会记住你说的话。"
    f1 "Sis, although you're a mortal who's made of flesh and bones, you seem to know a lot more about romance than I do. I'll remember your words."

# game/script.rpy:617
translate english a_4_9_8975f24d:

    # "这时，阿轩端了一碗牛肉面走来。里面的酱汁沾满了牛肉，面条看起来也味道十足。"
    "Then Ah-Xuan brings a bowl of beef noodle soup to us. It has a lot of beef and soy sauce, juicy and rich in colors."

# game/script.rpy:618
translate english a_4_9_80c2c2da:

    # "就这样我们三人吃完了整整一大碗的牛肉面。"
    "We finish a huge bowl of beef noodle soup in an instant."

# game/script.rpy:620
translate english a_4_9_8eb1c208:

    # mc_1 "对了九妹，你是仙人，想必也会腾云驾雾之术吧？能教教我吗？"
    mc_1 "Jiumei, if you're a celestial being, you must know how to fly. Could you teach me how to?"

# game/script.rpy:621
translate english a_4_9_bb9690ae:

    # f1 "（面有难色）可是倒是可以。只是凡人学习仙术倒是挺难的。"
    f1 "(Reluctant) Sure, but a mortal will struggle a lot when learning magic."

# game/script.rpy:622
translate english a_4_9_b46d2b1d:

    # mc_1 "不急，我们去前面的小树林里吧。那里人少，不会有什么问题的！"
    mc_1 "Don't worry about it. I will take my time. Let's walk to the forest ahead, there's not gonna be a lot of people there. We won't have any issues."

# game/script.rpy:624
translate english a_4_9_9a370223:

    # f1 "先说好若是你突然掉下来，我真的不知道该是如何了。"
    f1 "I gotta warn you first that if you fall, I don't know how to help."

# game/script.rpy:625
translate english a_4_9_b2388131:

    # mc_1 "别担心，我其实一点都不害怕。若是能学会怎么飞，那以后我必定要飞过五湖四海外，直到那蓬莱仙岛去学习仙术。"
    mc_1 "I'm not afraid. As long as I learn how to fly, then I can soar above the earth and travel beyond the four seas. Perhaps I'll eventually land on a fairy island."

# game/script.rpy:626
translate english a_4_9_979c6212:

    # f1 "其实咒语很简单，可是就算告诉你也于事无补。没有修为的凡人，几乎是不可能学会飞行之术的。"
    f1 "The spell is really easy to remember. And if I do tell you, nothing will happen. As a mortal, if you don't have a background in cultivation, then you won't be able to fly."

# game/script.rpy:627
translate english a_4_9_44bc3c67:

    # mc_1 "好啦好啦，我的好妹妹。就告诉我是什么吧。"
    mc_1 "Alright alright. Just tell me what it is already. I can't wait to try"

# game/script.rpy:629
translate english a_4_9_17935c44:

    # "不过一会，我就踩着云朵飞到空中。不仅看到了平日看不到的景色，就连贪睡的小松鼠和吃着果子的小鸟也收入了眼底。"
    "In a few seconds, I can already land on clouds and float on air. Not only I get to see more of the world, but also I can capture all the scenes with my bare eyes. "
    "I see little squirrels and birds landing on different branches."

# game/script.rpy:630
translate english a_4_9_85c9517d:

    # "这一切对我来说很是新奇，所以我兴奋地开始到处在林子里游荡。"
    "It's all so new to me that I start to linger in different parts of the forest."

# game/script.rpy:632
translate english a_4_9_7e888e76:

    # f1 "（不敢相信）天啊，你竟然真的飞起来了！ 若是凡人，怎能有如此的造化。我看姐姐必有仙根。"
    f1 "(In disbelief) Oh wow, you're flying! It's impossible for mortals to fly. You must have some special powers that set you apart from normal people."

# game/script.rpy:634
translate english a_4_9_ac9d6143:

    # mc_1 "真的吗？我在上面飞，顿时觉得你们好小啊。上面的凉风很舒服呢！等等，我去那边看看！"
    mc_1 "Really? You guys look so tiny. The air above is really cool and fresh. Just a moment, lemme explore first."

# game/script.rpy:635
translate english a_4_9_bb4e0793:

    # "我经过了东海湾，飞到了皇城外，又转到了山上去。对嘛，这才是我西凉公主该体验的生活！"
    "I fly across the East China Sea, out of the imperial palace, above the mountains and seas. This is exactly what I've been dreamt about."

# game/script.rpy:637
translate english a_4_9_2a9ac635:

    # "在一片桃花树下，我偶然之间看到了一个俊朗的少年。他抬头一望，好似发现了我。"
    "Under a peach blossom tree, I see a comely youth in white. As he lifts up his head, he sets his eyes on me."

# game/script.rpy:638
translate english a_4_9_fb4c76e7:

    # "这男子说不定是在这山上修炼的居士吧，他会不会误以为我是仙女下凡呢？这日后说不定还是一则美谈呢！"
    "He's probably a disciple of a martial arts grandmaster. Will he mistake me as a celestial being or goddess? "
    "Maybe my presence will leave this guy a great impression, and later on create a myth that's unheard of."

# game/script.rpy:639
translate english a_4_9_7bc2986c:

    # "我向他招了招手又飘去了 远方。"
    "I wave at him and then fly away."

# game/script.rpy:641
translate english a_4_9_7fb05e3f:

    # "飞到永安酒楼之上，我又看见了上元节那天的店主和她的伙计们。"
    "I fly above the Yong-An restaurant, and I can clearly see the owner and her workers."

# game/script.rpy:642
translate english a_4_9_4a843e79:

    # "因为我停在比较高的位置，没有人发现了我。"
    "Although I'm standing on a higher elevation, they can still see me. Some are complimenting my outfit, others are too surprised to see a flying human. "

# game/script.rpy:644
translate english a_4_9_4b7f395b:

    # "接着我看遍了京都的桃花，越过了西凉最高的城楼，眺望着城里的居民们。花瓣纷纷飘散在空中，缓缓地飘落在城下。"
    "Next, I get to see all the peach flowers in the capital city, fly across the country's tallest building, and start to observe passing pedestrians."
    "Petals are almost everywhere, showering down on the people below me."

# game/script.rpy:645
translate english a_4_9_89c3d555:

    # "就这样，一片姹紫嫣红染红了西凉的半边天。"
    "As a result, the sky becomes a vermillion drape as the red and pink petals add more colors to it."

# game/script.rpy:647
translate english a_4_9_fad377bd:

    # "若是没有看错，昔日遇见的少年郎正在用着扇子遮着头，以免花瓣飘落在他的黑发上。"
    "If my eyes serve right, the youth from last night is covering his hair with a fan, avoiding the kissings of the petals"

# game/script.rpy:648
translate english a_4_9_bbda6ee5:

    # "有些依依不舍，我还是飞回了树林里。"
    "With longingnes, I fly back to the forest."

# game/script.rpy:649
translate english a_4_9_30b2d8d3:

    # "刹那间，他的容貌使得整个京都的花朵都毫无颜色。"
    "In an instant, his face makes all the flowers in the capital city less attractive than they actually are"

# game/script.rpy:650
translate english a_4_9_92b55ada:

    # "慢慢地，我觉得有些疲惫，难道说是第一次飞，体力不够了？"
    "Gradually, I feel more fatigued. Is it because I'm flying for the very first time?"

# game/script.rpy:653
translate english a_4_9_01cf579b:

    # mc_1 "我好像怎么觉得飞的没有之前那么高了？而且四肢越来越累了？"
    mc_1 "I can't fly as high as I wish to, and my extremities are getting sore more than ever."

# game/script.rpy:654
translate english a_4_9_b6a99204:

    # f1 "一定是因为你还得有修行的底子才能继续飞行。"
    f1 "It's because you don't have enough experience in cultivation."

# game/script.rpy:655
translate english a_4_9_d00290d3:

    # mc_1 "不行了，我快支撑不住了。感觉快要掉下来了！"
    mc_1 "Oh no, I don't think I can float in the air anymore. I'm gonna fall!"

# game/script.rpy:657
translate english a_4_9_292f55d2:

    # f1 "啊？我。。。我怕接不住你。。。来人啊！救命啊！！来人啊！！！"
    f1 "Whoa, I… I'm afraid that I can't catch you… Someone please help. Anyone!"

# game/script.rpy:658
translate english a_4_9_9c857ede:

    # "就这样，九妹和阿轩在下面急救的呐喊着。。。作为西凉的公主，我还是平生第一次觉得这么丢人。。。。"
    "As a result, Jiumei and Ah-Xuan decide to desperately cry for help. As a princess, it's one of the most embarrassing moments of my life."

# game/script.rpy:661
translate english a_4_9_293d675e:

    # "就在我体力不支，觉得一切都要完了的时候，突然几段白色的丝绸从空中飘来，紧紧地缠住了我的腰。"
    "Just as when I feel like everything is going to end, several long pieces of white cloth float in the air, tightly wrapping my waist to keep me secured."

# game/script.rpy:662
translate english a_4_9_0bbee845:

    # "接着我看到大郎腾云驾雾而来，他抱住了留在空中的我。四目相对，我才发现他温暖的手覆盖着了我的肩，另一只接住了我的腿。"
    "Then I see Da Lang standing on white clouds, catching me as I slowly drift away."
    "As we look into each other's eyes, I then realize one of his hands is resting on my shoulder, and the other holding my legs."

# game/script.rpy:663
translate english a_4_9_b62a96f4:

    # "初次与男子这么耳鬓厮磨着，我的心 一直扑通扑通地跳着。被大郎这么抱着， 我觉得有些甜蜜。"
    "It's an intimate moment that I've never experienced before. My heart pounds heavily. I feel like it trembles in a manner that I've never felt before."

# game/script.rpy:664
translate english a_4_9_053ea66d:

    # "我的脸微微的贴在了他的胸上。此时，他是否也为我紧张了呢？"
    "With my cheeks close to his chest, I'm more nervous than ever. Is he worried about me?"

# game/script.rpy:666
translate english a_4_9_19eaa46e:

    # f1 "原来是表哥！我们得救了！"
    f1 "Oh, it's my cousin. We're safe!"

# game/script.rpy:668
translate english a_4_9_429a75fc:

    # one "下一次可不许这么胡闹了。"
    one "You should never play around with sorcery."

# game/script.rpy:670
translate english a_4_9_d658dab4:

    # mc_1 "嗯！下一次我一定先从最基础学起。 咦？你怎么也会飞？而且九妹叫你表哥，难道说你也是仙人？"
    mc_1 "Sure, next time I'll start with the basics. But, why are you able to fly? Jiumei said you're her cousin, are you also a deity?"

# game/script.rpy:672
translate english a_4_9_30e42c7a:

    # one "今日之事不可告知他人。凡人不该知道我们的身份。"
    one "You shall never reveal our identities to others."

# game/script.rpy:673
translate english a_4_9_925efc4f:

    # mc_1 "放心吧，本公主绝对不会告诉其他人的。"
    mc_1 "Don't worry about it, I'll never let anyone know, I promise."

# game/script.rpy:674
translate english a_4_9_82ca14c9:

    # f1 "表哥这次能来真是太好了！昨夜你买的花灯甚是好看，今日又救了这位姐姐。 我该怎么感谢你才好？"
    f1 "Cousin, I'm so glad that you're here. The lanterns you brought last night really made my day. And just now you saved my friend. I'm so grateful to have you here."

# game/script.rpy:675
translate english a_4_9_68c971cd:

    # "这是我第一次看到平时镇定的大郎这么认真的看着一个女孩子，于是心里有些五味杂陈的。"
    "It's my first time seeing him looking at a girl like this. I feel a little displeased."

# game/script.rpy:677
translate english a_4_9_95fd8fc1:

    # mc_1 "你们是亲表兄妹不成，可是血脉相连？"
    mc_1 "Are you guys related by blood?"

# game/script.rpy:679
translate english a_4_9_a08f8e33:

    # one "（有些在意）不，只是名义上如此。九妹的母亲和我的母亲未修成正果时乃是结拜姐妹。"
    one "No, we're not. Jiumei's mother and my mother used to be best friends when they're merely mortals."

# game/script.rpy:680
translate english a_4_9_1b29f86b:

    # f1 "是啊，可是我一直都把表哥当做亲哥哥来看待。虽没有血缘关系，但是我早就把他当成了最信赖的兄长。"
    f1 "Right, I always call him my cousin because he's like a brother to me. We're not related by blood, but I've always seen him as an older brother"

# game/script.rpy:682
translate english a_4_9_7d192379:

    # "这时大郎的眼神有些失神落魄，虽然是短短的一瞬间，可是我还是轻易捕捉到了他失望的神情。那不成他只是单相思？"
    "I can see how Da Lang looks disappointed for a second. Although it only lasted a second, I can easily capture his emotions because I care so much about how he feels."

# game/script.rpy:683
translate english a_4_9_fe9744e2:

    # mc_1 "也是，世人都说血浓于水，可长期的陪伴和照顾与家人的情感早就不可分离了。"
    mc_1 "Right, when people get to see each other a lot, we often interpret those feelings as familial love or sibling love."

# game/script.rpy:685
translate english a_4_9_28fb09b7:

    # one "（转移话题）你们怎么会遇见对方？东海龙宫守卫森严，公主不可能把九妹带出来。"
    one "(Changes the subject) So how did you two meet? There's a lot of guards in the dragon palace. They all have supernatural powers."
    one " Princess, you can't take her out when you're new to sorcery."

# game/script.rpy:686
translate english a_4_9_ecb27705:

    # f1 "是之前的一个大哥哥带我出来的。可是我早已答应他不告诉其他人他的身份。就算表哥问起，我也不会说的。"
    f1 "It's another big brother that took me out. I promised him not to reveal his identity. If you ask me, I'm not gonna tell you anything."

# game/script.rpy:687
translate english a_4_9_86287d83:

    # one "此人绝非等闲之辈。他若是能入海必有神通。自古人心难测，九妹可别中了其他人的圈套。"
    one "This guy must be really powerful. If he can swim underwater and explore the deep sea, then he must have some supernatural powers. "
    one "Jiumei, you should be more careful. Humans can be really dangerous."

# game/script.rpy:688
translate english a_4_9_f2349b0e:

    # f1 "才不是呢！我看公主就是一个好人。她带我去吃糖人了，而且走在京都的街上可比海里游好玩多了。"
    f1 "I don't think so. Princess Murong is a human, but she's a great person. She bought me a lot of candies and snacks."
    f1 "Walking on the street is so much more fun than swimming underwater."

# game/script.rpy:690
translate english a_4_9_25a7662d:

    # mc_1 "是啊！本公主就是个大好人。若是下次，我还想和九妹出来到处看看。这京都的大雁塔，明月楼，还有望日潭都还没去看呢！"
    mc_1 "Yeah, people are inherently good. I'm a great person. Actually, I want to take her out again and explore the capital city. "
    mc_1 "We've got so many places to explore: the Giant Wild Goose Pagoda, Chamber of the Bright Moon, and the Wangri Pond."

# game/script.rpy:691
translate english a_4_9_e41fc564:

    # f1 "对啊，对啊，我好多地方都没去过呢，表哥和我们一起吧。"
    f1 "Yeah, there are so many places I haven't explored before. Cousin, you should come with us."

# game/script.rpy:693
translate english a_4_9_172e73a1:

    # one "若是九妹想见人间的美景，那有何难。"
    one "(Looks at her) If you really say so, Jiumei. I can never say no to you."

# game/script.rpy:694
translate english a_4_9_50a33243:

    # mc_1 "（眼睛一转，想到什么）明月楼可是情侣定情的地方，九妹有她的未婚夫可以陪同，大郎要是和我们一起去的话，是不是想向我表白的意思？"
    mc_1 "(In preoccupied thoughts) The Chamber of the Bright Moon is a popular site for couples. Jiumei will have the company of her fiance. "
    mc_1 "f Da Lang comes along, it's gonna be just the two of us. Are you implying something?"
# game/script.rpy:695
translate english a_4_9_fd420aeb:

    # "这一问大郎竟然哑口无言。他长长的睫毛微微动了动，好似是在想着怎么回答我的问题。脸上一阵粉，过了好久才散去。"
    "He becomes speechless for the next few moments. His long, delicate eyelashes move as he blinks, as if perturbed by my question. "
    "Heavy blush melts his cheeks, and they finally dissipate with the passing of time."

# game/script.rpy:697
translate english a_4_9_79c89518:

    # one "公主果真是古灵精怪。（轻咳）本尊从未去过明月楼，自然不曾这么想。"
    one "Princess, you're a mischievous one. (Coughs) I've never been to the Chamber of the Bright Moon before, how would I know it's a place for couples to visit?"

# game/script.rpy:698
translate english a_4_9_aee939cf:

    # f1 "哈哈，每次表哥害羞都会这样。"
    f1 "Every time when my cousin gets shy, he'll act like this. Haha."

# game/script.rpy:699
translate english a_4_9_dd2a7da9:

    # "我的心里一阵暗喜，看来要收服高冷的大郎也不是难事嘛。就在这时，他又看向了九妹，使我觉得是不是前功尽弃了？"
    "Overjoyed, I think it shouldn't be too hard to get his attention. Yet, he looks at her again, which makes me feel like giving up."

# game/script.rpy:701
translate english a_4_9_88beb061:

    # f1 "（拿出一颗珠子）此物乃是定水珠。若是带上，公主可自由出入东海。我还想和公主一起玩呢。"
    f1 "(Takes a sphere from her pocket) It's a crystal marble ball. If you carry it with you, then you may swim freely underwater just like how you can walk on land."
    f1 "I want to hang out with Princess Murong again."

# game/script.rpy:702
translate english a_4_9_39904e6b:

    # mc_1 "（接过宝物）哇，这珠子真的有这么神奇？若是如此，我也送给你我的贴身玉佩。上面有我的名字，“凌。“ 以后九妹就叫我阿凌吧。"
    mc_1 "(Accepts her gift) What a wonderful gift! If so, I should give you something in return. This is my jade pendant with my first name carved on the surface, \"Ling\". "
    mc_1 "From now on, Jiumei ought to call me by my name and skip all the formality."
# game/script.rpy:704
translate english a_4_9_e5c1ac86:

    # one "一个是东海公主，一个是西凉公主。我看以后人界会被你们大闹一场。"
    one "Princess of the East China Sea and Princess of Xiliang. I guess the mortal realm will never be the same with your alliance."

# game/script.rpy:706
translate english a_4_9_b0ef20ad:

    # mc_1 "这样才好呢！若是安于平淡无趣的日子那就算是公主都要烦死了。不如大郎有时也来皇宫找我，这样我们也能多聊聊啊。"
    mc_1 "Isn't that a good thing? I'm tired of banality and want to explore something new. You should visit me in the imperial palace so we can keep in touch."

# game/script.rpy:708
translate english a_4_9_d57fb2c1:

    # one "我本曾经守卫过西凉，可奈何举国上下开始信奉妖道，于是我便不再附身于皇宫的塑像里。还是从长计议吧。"
    one "I used to be one of the guardians of Xiliang, but the whole country started to worship devils. I eventually stopped being a guardian due to other reasons."

# game/script.rpy:710
translate english a_4_9_de104b6f:

    # "现在我开始相信阿轩告诉我的话。原来大郎的真身是曾经的守护神之一奈何父皇开始被国师的妖术迷惑，使得大郎不再接受西凉的供奉。"
    "Now I start to believe in what Ah-Xuan has told me. Da Lang's true form is a guardian deity that used to protect our country, but when my father had a new prime minister, everything has just changed."

# game/script.rpy:711
translate english a_4_9_1e2fb300:

    # "告别了大郎和九妹，我有些兴致的回到了皇宫里。"
    "I said goodbye to both of them, and then swiftly returned to the palace."

# game/script.rpy:714
translate english a_4_9_96b2d7fd:

    # npc1 "你带人去哪了？"
    npc1 "Where did you bring her to?"

# game/script.rpy:715
translate english a_4_9_e418c35b:

    # "真不走运，一回来就撞见国师！"
    "Oh no, it's the prime minister!"

# game/script.rpy:716
translate english a_4_9_e62bab2c:

    # mc_1 "就是出去玩了玩，怎么这也有错？"
    mc_1 "Just going out and having some fun. Why, have I committed a crime?"

# game/script.rpy:717
translate english a_4_9_33c0baf1:

    # npc1 "（眼神犀利）公主为何不带她回来？可知她本该是协助微臣来研究丹药的？若是坏了大事，这该当如何？"
    npc1 "(Sharp) Your Grace, why didn't you bring her back? She's supposed to assist me in completing a major potion. You have indeed committed a crime."

# game/script.rpy:719
translate english a_4_9_012aadfa:

    # mc_1 "依我看，若是带九妹回来，你肯定是要软禁她吧。有些人自己不安好心，本公主是不会放手不管的。"
    mc_1 "If I brought her back, you'd lock her up and make her suffer. I'm not gonna let you hurt her."

# game/script.rpy:721
translate english a_4_9_99368686:

    # npc1 "（眉头一怒）公主若是平日小打小闹，微臣可以置之不理。这回公主管的实在是太宽了。九妹乃是我的上等贵宾，微臣怎可软禁她？"
    npc1 "(Eyebrows furrowed) If you're just playing around, I wouldn't mind at all. But this time is different. Jiumei is my guest, why would I incarcerate her?"

# game/script.rpy:723
translate english a_4_9_d807ea6e:

    # mc_1 "这西凉的天可不是国师一人撑着的。本宫要什么人还要向你先报告不成？真是天大的笑话。"
    mc_1 "You need to know who owns this place. I'm a princess, as a royal, I am above you. Do you expect me to report every little thing to you? That's ridiculous"

# game/script.rpy:724
translate english a_4_9_51adf279:

    # npc1 "公主果真是任性惯了，看来微臣要为公主占卜一卦，让公主早日寻到夫婿。是时候让人来管管你的性子了。"
    npc1 "You're too stubborn and sassy. I'll need to read your sign again and find you a partner to control you."

# game/script.rpy:725
translate english a_4_9_eeb4e493:

    # mc_1 "本宫可不信你的卦象。我看国师才是被宠惯了，以为自己能与本宫如此说话。"
    mc_1 "I don't believe in your readings. You are the stubborn one here. How dare you talk to me like this?"

# game/script.rpy:727
translate english a_4_9_1a4aa7eb:

    # npc1 "（语气平和许多）刚才是微臣说话重了些，现在先行赔罪。公主确实到了该出嫁的年纪。微臣觉得自己在西凉也有些声望，算的上是人中之龙，还希望能与公主结成秦晋之缘。"
    npc1 "(Calms down) I shouldn't have raised my voice. I do apologize for my indecency, Your Grace. But you're now at an age where you should be married."
    npc1 "As a high ranking official, I feel like I'm qualified to be your husband."

# game/script.rpy:728
translate english a_4_9_73f432a8:

    # npc1 "微臣不仅懂得长生不老之术，而且也能让公主青春永驻。我也有信心能给公主要的幸福。"
    npc1 "Not only I know how to make the elixir of life, but also I can make potions of youth. I know how to best treat a princess."

# game/script.rpy:729
translate english a_4_9_bbbe803b:

    # "我看得出来国师这回是真心诚意的想要讨好我，但是每每想到他做的那些伤天害理之事，我就不能接受他的爱慕。"
    "Maybe he's trying to be nice this time, but I can't tolerate the kind of horrible things he does to other people."

# game/script.rpy:731
translate english a_4_9_390c8b1c:

    # mc_1 "国师误解了。青春永驻对我来说并不是最重要的事情。若是没有感情的基础，本宫是绝对不会招驸马的。"
    mc_1 "You must be mistaken. Youth and immortality aren't the most important things to me. I want real affection that can last a whole lifetime. And I'm not in love with you."

# game/script.rpy:732
translate english a_4_9_e60a314a:

    # npc1 "若是公主想要自由，那今后微臣可不必管着公主，让你做自己想做的事不管你想要什么，微臣都一定能拿到。"
    npc1 "If you want freedom, then I'll give you freedom. I'd let you do whatever you want to do."

# game/script.rpy:733
translate english a_4_9_f6cb42a0:

    # mc_1 "笑话，本宫现在什么都不缺。你如此局限的自由哪是本宫所要的？以后我可不想听到你提这事了。"
    mc_1 "That's ridiculous. You're talking about the bare minimum for an average person."
    mc_1 "I'm a princess. I don't need anything from you. Now you should leave."

# game/script.rpy:734
translate english a_4_9_bebb2d8c:

    # "接着我有些不耐烦的离开了御花园，直接回到了寝宫。"
    "With no more patience left, I decide to leave the imperial garden and go back to my room."

# game/script.rpy:737
translate english a_4_9_b8cd50d1:

    # "一回来我就发现小傻子六郎在专心打坐。看他这么专心的样子，我还真不想打扰他。"
    "As I return, I see the little silly thing, Liu Lang, meditating on the floor. He looks really attentive, so I don't want to distract him."

# game/script.rpy:738
translate english a_4_9_b3670133:

    # "谁知听到我的脚步声，六郎微微睁开眼睛。他有些开心又有点埋怨地看着我。"
    "As he hears my footsteps, Liu Lang slowly opens his eyes. His expression is a mixture of delight and frustration."

# game/script.rpy:740
translate english a_4_9_f45038ec:

    # six "阿轩姐姐说你去了宫外，为何不带我一同前往？怎么把我丢在着不熟悉的宫殿之中？"
    six "Ah-Xuan said you left this morning, why didn't you bring me with you? This is your room, not mine."

# game/script.rpy:741
translate english a_4_9_e30a019c:

    # mc_1 "还不是因为本公主是和姑娘出去一起玩，若是带你这个郎君去了，那多不方便啊。女孩子的话题你又插不上。"
    mc_1 "I went out with a lady friend. If I brought you along with us, it would be weird. You don't know what we would talk about."

# game/script.rpy:742
translate english a_4_9_9b00a6db:

    # six "（恍然大悟）原来你是替我着想啊？"
    six "Oh, so you're concerned about me."

# game/script.rpy:743
translate english a_4_9_0ab45f0e:

    # mc_1 "哈哈，那是自然啦。对了，阿轩去哪了？"
    mc_1 "Haha, of course. Where is my private assistant, Ah-Xuan?"

# game/script.rpy:744
translate english a_4_9_cc754628:

    # six "阿轩姐姐有感风寒，她已经先去歇息了。"
    six "She's sick, caught a cold, and had a fever. I told her to rest early."

# game/script.rpy:745
translate english a_4_9_5c4ff3a3:

    # mc_1 "什么！那一定要让最好的太医给她医治。 本宫先去看看阿轩，你在这里等我。"
    mc_1 "What. That's awful. I'll order the best medicine for her. I'll visit her now, wait for me to return."

# game/script.rpy:746
translate english a_4_9_53079532:

    # "于是我花了剩下的时间看望阿轩，直到晚上才放心回去。"
    "Then I spent the rest of the day at her place. I returned in the evening."

# game/script.rpy:751
translate english scene_b_c7d465ba:

    # "喝完孟婆汤后，我的意识渐渐消失。这一世，我生在一个平凡的商人家中，父母还算恩爱，虽然有时会吵吵架。"
    "In this life, I am the daughter of a restaurant owner. My parents are supportive and loving. Even though they do get into small fights sometimes."

# game/script.rpy:752
translate english scene_b_4f506f6a:

    # "我们家的酒楼生意最近有些不景气，多半是因为厨子的厨艺真的不怎么样，而且很多伙计都偷懒。"
    "Business has been really slow lately. Not only our chef isn't good at his job, but also a lot of workers tend to be lazy."

# game/script.rpy:754
translate english scene_b_5a89af76:

    # "马上要到元宵节了， 我得想想办法经营酒楼才是，估计店里的伙计也要好好整顿一番。"
    "The Lantern festival is around the corner. Maybe it's gonna boost our business. I really need to think about how to manage everything."

# game/script.rpy:755
translate english scene_b_abc3f1b2:

    # "想到这里，我就觉得心烦，我要去哪里看看？"
    "I can't help but feel stressed by all the daily hassles. Where should I go?"

# game/script.rpy:760
translate english scene_b_489b59d1:

    # mom "这是要来喂猪的吗？厨子。这饭能吃嘛？"
    mom "Oh, this food is horrible! We don't even feed pigs with this crap. How can our customers take a bite of this?"

# game/script.rpy:761
translate english scene_b_ef6fce3b:

    # "还没等我进店就听到我娘在数落厨子的声音。还是等等他们说完我再进去吧。"
    "Before going in, I can already hear my mom's voice all the way from the entrance. Maybe I should let her and the chef have a private conversation first."

# game/script.rpy:766
translate english b_1a_6c4b3b3a:

    # "我在店外发现了一个俊俏的小哥，可是他似乎没打算进去"
    "I spot a cute guy outside of our restaurant, but it seems like he has no intention of going in."

# game/script.rpy:768
translate english b_1a_cb3acb49:

    # "他对我微微一笑，我本打算搭讪一下，奈何他却先一步离开了，真是一个奇怪的人啊。"
    "He gives me a warm smile, but before I can make any move, he turns his head to leave. What a weird guy."

# game/script.rpy:772
translate english b_1a_16ddada6:

    # "坐在东海湾的岩石旁，我看到了两个鬼鬼祟祟的人，好像是两位姑娘？随着她们的视线，我发现她们原来是在偷看前面的两位男子。"
    "Sitting on a large rock by the gulf of the East China Sea, I see two girls stalking on two guys in white garments."

# game/script.rpy:774
translate english b_1a_816cb75b:

    # "那两位姑娘不知道嘀咕了什么，估计是在打量前面的背影？不过背影都这么帅，估计正脸也一定让人痴迷。"
    "I am unsure of what they might have said, but maybe they are appreciating the aesthetic of the two guys?"
    "Not gonna lie, the guys look great from the back, so they are probably very easy on the eyes."

# game/script.rpy:776
translate english b_1a_170bdaa7:

    # "看到这里，我起身走到东海湾的北面。"
    "I decide to walk to the north side of the gulf."

# game/script.rpy:780
translate english b_1a_926ecf49:

    # "提起裙子，脱下鞋子，我坐在石头上，脚浸泡在温暖的海水里。疲惫就像海浪一样流走了。我无意地转了一下头。"
    "Taking off my shoes, I lift up my dress to soak my feet in the warm ocean water. I feel as if my fatigueness is slowly dissipating."
    "Having nothing else to worry about, I look away to examine my surroundings."

# game/script.rpy:784
translate english b_1a_183815e0:

    # "一个看起来十七，八九的少年似乎尴尬地和我对上了眼。可能是因为我把裙子提高到膝盖旁，他的神情有些转变。"
    "A young man in his late teens immediately meets my eye. Perhaps I shouldn't have lifted my dress to my knee because his expressions change as he looks down."

# game/script.rpy:788
translate english b_1a_f34d7e6d:

    # "他先是尴尬一笑，脸上布满了红晕。我下意识地把裙子拉低到小腿旁，谁知他再和我对视时，竟然看起来很震惊。"
    "He awkwardly smiles at me, and his face is flushed with red hues. I then cover my legs all the way down to my calves. But he looks alarmed when taking a look at me again."

# game/script.rpy:790
translate english b_1a_960a8c49:

    # "恼人的是他竟然拿起一颗石子，向我的方向投了过来。我的反射神经比一般人强，可是我跳起来时，石子打到了膝盖。"
    "Unexpected, he throws a piece of rock in my direction, which makes me upset. My reflex is quicker than most people, I jump up yet the stone still hits my knee."

# game/script.rpy:792
translate english b_1a_2875401b:

    # "见到我生气的神情，少年似乎知道接下会发生什么，他丢下了他的马，拔腿就跑。"
    "Seeing how furious I am, he knows what will happen next and runs away leaving his horse behind."

# game/script.rpy:796
translate english b_1a_9b690eb5:

    # mc2 "喂，小子，你别跑。"
    mc2 "Hey, punk, stop running."

# game/script.rpy:798
translate english b_1a_dcc7177b:

    # "以我多年跑堂的经验，追上这少年不是什么问题。"
    "With the years I've spent running around in the restaurant, catching him is easy."

# game/script.rpy:804
translate english b_1a_8a5f0784:

    # "奇怪的是当我抓住他的肩，他转头的那一刻，似乎这个少年比刚刚那位还年少。"
    "It is strange. I grab him by his shoulder but when he turns around, he looks much younger than that other person"

# game/script.rpy:806
translate english b_1a_4ef9dc5a:

    # five "不是我，不是我做的。"
    five "It's not me, I didn't do it."

# game/script.rpy:808
translate english b_1a_b5491d66:

    # "我还什么都没说呢，做贼心虚。身高体型都差不多，怎么看起来比刚刚那个人小了几岁?"
    "I haven't said anything. Feeling guilty? Both of their height and stature are similar but this person seems to be at a younger age."

# game/script.rpy:810
translate english b_1a_027c1775:

    # "虽然这少年比我高了一个头，我左手拽着他的衣领，右手按着他的脖子，他逃不掉了。"
    "This boy may be taller than me but I can grab him by his collar with my left hand and his neck with my right. There's no chance of escaping for him."

# game/script.rpy:812
translate english b_1a_c73dea75:

    # five "(脸上的红晕未褪)这位姐姐，你认错人啦。"
    five "(His face is still blushing) Hey sis, you've mistaken me for someone else."

# game/script.rpy:816
translate english b_1a_44300c55:

    # mc2 "不可能，你的武器这么显眼，我不可能认错。而且，你和刚刚那人长得极为相似。"
    mc2 "Impossible, your weapon is so flashy. There is no way I will mistake you for someone else. Moreso, you look very much like the person I'm looking for."

# game/script.rpy:820
translate english b_1a_07e59592:

    # five "(眼睛转了转)那是因为刚刚那是我的—三哥。和我没关系(试图笑了笑)"
    five "(Eye rolls) It's because that was my third brother. I have nothing to do in this. (forcing a smile)
"

# game/script.rpy:822
translate english b_1a_29078eaa:

    # "我觉得这少年很-"
    "I feel like this boy is- "

# game/script.rpy:831
translate english b2_82b7f7d4:

    # mc2 "那你三哥为什么拿石头砸我？"
    mc2 "Why did your third brother hit me with a rock?"

# game/script.rpy:833
translate english b2_7cb2838a:

    # five "不是砸你，是为了保护你。(看到我发怒的眼神)刚刚有一条水蛇在岸边。"
    five "Not on purpose. He only did it to protect you. (Seeing the anger in my eyes)  There was a water snake by the shoreline."

# game/script.rpy:835
translate english b2_f85f5f87:

    # mc2 "我怎么没看见啊？"
    mc2 "How come I didn't see it?"

# game/script.rpy:837
translate english b2_cb467f07:

    # five "还不是被你吓跑了，是我—三哥多管闲事了。(准备起身离开)"
    five "It was scared away by you. I shouldn't be a meddler afterall. (Preparing to stand up and leave)"

# game/script.rpy:839
translate english b2_65e01cad:

    # mc2 "（微微一笑)没关系，哥哥跑了，弟弟就留下来在酒楼打杂吧。哪天你哥敢来姐姐我的地盘，你就得救了。走吧。"
    mc2 "(Slightly smiles) It's alright, since your brother ran away and left you behind, you'll stay and work at the restaurant."
    mc2 "You will stay with me until your third brother comes. Let's go."

# game/script.rpy:841
translate english b2_ff6cc7e2:

    # "我准备怎么带这少年回家？"
    "How am I going to bring this boy home?"

# game/script.rpy:845
translate english b2_83f885d6:

    # five "这位姐姐，我是不会逃走的(轻松地掙开了绳子)说真的，我多久可以离开啊？"
    five "Hey sis, I'm not going to run away. (Easily broke loose the rope) Seriously though, when can I leave?"

# game/script.rpy:846
translate english b2_2be6f68a:

    # mc2 "喂，浪费了我绳子的钱。看你在店里的表现吧。"
    mc2 "Hey, you just wasted my rope money. It will depend on your performance."

# game/script.rpy:850
translate english b2_ffd421f3:

    # "原本这少年还想为自己辩解，我抓住了他的手臂，转眼间他竟突然安静下来了。"
    "Initially, this teen wanted to defend himself but he became silent as I grabbed his arm."

# game/script.rpy:851
translate english b2_fe0311ba:

    # "走过桃花小巷，我转眼看了看酒楼前的桃花树，少年小心翼翼地移开了落在我头上的花瓣。"
    "Walking through the alley of peach blossom trees, I glance over to the flowers in front of the restaurant."
    "The boy carefully removes the petals that fall on my head."

# game/script.rpy:852
translate english b2_fdcf3a65:

    # "当一群年长的邻居和熟人看到我们并且投来异样眼光时，我飞快地走进了店里。"
    "A group of my neighbors sees us and gives us a weird look. I hasten my pace into the restaurant "

# game/script.rpy:858
translate english b3_53a112d4:

    # mom "老张，你听还是不听，这几个菜色必须换。"
    mom "Old Zhang, are you listening, these dishes need to be changed."

# game/script.rpy:860
translate english b3_8e16f2ce:

    # z "嗨哟，我就是不听。你们这个店没我还真不行。工资少还吝啬。"
    z "Oy, I am not gonna listen to you. Your restaurant will not survive without me. Ain't nobody can stand your minimum wage."

# game/script.rpy:862
translate english b3_a9b1198f:

    # "本来我打算劝架的，谁知道一阵声响转移了他们的注意力。我们很快都上楼去查看发生了什么变化。"
    "I intend to stop the fight but suddenly a loud noise interrupts us. We go upstairs to investigate."

# game/script.rpy:864
translate english b3_e052e40b:

    # "新来的伙计，小七，原来打破了娘最爱的古董花瓶。我心里暗叫不好。这可是娘喜爱的嫁妆"
    "This is not good, the new waiter, Xiao Qi, broke mother's favorite antique vase. That vase was part of her dowry."

# game/script.rpy:865
translate english b3_8c0f66b9:

    # "我关心的是"
    "What concerns me"

# game/script.rpy:874
translate english b4_f441a556:

    # "让我意外的是我身旁的少年马上冲到了小七身旁，似乎很担心小七的伤势。"
    "Surprisingly, the boy next to me runs over to Xiao Qi. He seems to be concerned if Xiao Qi was injured."

# game/script.rpy:876
translate english b4_f33b03f7:

    # five "七郞，你的伤怎么愈合的这么久？"
    five "Qi Lang, why is your injury taking so long to heal?"

# game/script.rpy:878
translate english b4_0f71f10b:

    # seven "你怎么在这里？是父亲要找我不成？"
    seven "Why are you here? Is father looking for me?"

# game/script.rpy:880
translate english b4_e4b4f237:

    # mom "我怎么招惹到你这个瘟神？这可是我奶奶留给我的，以后要送给我女儿的"
    mom "What have I done to meet an obnoxious person like you? That was a gift from my grandmother. It was supposed to be passed down to my daughter."

# game/script.rpy:882
translate english b4_bfdb2634:

    # "娘说完竟然倒头在我肩膀上，伤心地哭了出来。不过一会儿她就注意到我带回来的陌生男子"
    "After my mom's done with yelling, she leans on my shoulder and cries."
    "It didn't take her too long to notice the stranger I brought home"

# game/script.rpy:884
translate english b4_292f5cfd:

    # mom "这是哪个邻居的儿子？怎么来拜访都没有带礼物啊。"
    mom "Which neighbor's son is this? Why did he not bring any gifts at his first visit?"

# game/script.rpy:886
translate english b4_7168ce77:

    # five "我在家中年纪排行第五，夫人叫我五郎便好。"
    five "Milady, I am the 5th child at home, please call me Wu Lang"

# game/script.rpy:888
translate english b4_51012e3e:

    # "这男子刚刚看起来还像个小孩子，怎么转眼就又像个成年人了？看来他果然是拿石头丢我的人。不过他好像不知道自己已经变回来了。"
    "This boy still looks like a child a moment ago, how did he suddenly become an adult? He was definitely the one that threw the rock at me."

# game/script.rpy:890
translate english b4_f438e0c3:

    # "看姐姐我怎么整治这个小坏蛋。好吧，就让他留下来打工吧。"
    "But it seems like he is unaware that he's reverted back to his mature self. Alright, I will let him work for us."

# game/script.rpy:892
translate english b4_44672e0f:

    # mc2 "(小声嘀咕)娘，这是新来的伙计。"
    mc2 "(whisper) Mother, this is the new staff."

# game/script.rpy:894
translate english b4_814f72a0:

    # mom "（有些顾虑）工资多少？"
    mom "(a bit hesitant)  How much are we paying him?"

# game/script.rpy:896
translate english b4_0b8f47f7:

    # "当我用右手比了一个 'o'形，娘安心地笑了。"
    "As I hold up my right hand to an “o” shape, my mom is really happy."

# game/script.rpy:900
translate english b4_d97a8b57:

    # mom "你们先出去，让我冷静冷静。"
    mom "You all may leave first, let me calm down"

# game/script.rpy:902
translate english b4_6dec301a:

    # five "小七打破的那个花瓶是不是很贵重啊？"
    five "Is the vase really expensive?"

# game/script.rpy:904
translate english b4_a3ba0eb7:

    # mc2 "那是我娘最爱的嫁妆。(柜子里找出一个盒子)这是金创药，给小七擦擦吧。"
    mc2 "That was my mother's favorite piece from her dowry. (I grabbed a box from the cabinet) This is medicine, give it to Xiao Qi."

# game/script.rpy:906
translate english b4_1fc15633:

    # seven "多谢姑娘。我下次一定会小心。"
    seven "Thank you, miss. I will be more careful next time."

# game/script.rpy:910
translate english b4_3d176a25:

    # "我本来想在外面透透气，可是眼前的情况让我有些不解。这五郎怎么在和空气说话？"
    "I want to take some fresh air outside, but what I am seeing is mind-boggling. Why is Wu Lang talking to himself?"

# game/script.rpy:912
translate english b4_f3e5bfd4:

    # "趁他还没发现我，我靠近了几步。"
    "I take a few steps closer before he notices me"

# game/script.rpy:914
translate english b4_7334e088:

    # five "你就帮帮我吧，让四哥知晓我和小七都在这永安酒楼里。"
    five "Please help me. At least let my fourth brother know that Xiao Qi and I have been stuck at Yong An Restaurant."

# game/script.rpy:916
translate english b4_ba33aa64:

    # "他这是在和树上的小鸟说话？"
    "Is he talking to the bird on the tree?"

# game/script.rpy:918
translate english b4_ed81cc31:

    # five "我回到天庭必定带你升仙(过了几秒，他看着树上的鸟儿，突然转身，对我一笑)"
    five "Once I get back to Heaven, I will definitely let you become a deity. (A few seconds passed, he looked up to the bird and turned around at me with a smile.)"

# game/script.rpy:920
translate english b4_ef1d9043:

    # "神奇的是那只鸟真的飞走了。看来这少年也懂得什么邪术？"
    "Like a miracle, the bird actually flies away. Does this boy know dark magic?"

# game/script.rpy:924
translate english b4_fbbdf144:

    # mc2 "院子里的桃花瓣怎么到处都是？五郎，我们进去吧"
    mc2 "Why are the peach blossom petals everywhere in the yard? Wu Lang, Let's go inside"

# game/script.rpy:926
translate english b4_a105a51b:

    # five "(接过扫把)哦，还不知道到姐姐芳名？"
    five "(Taking the broom) Hey, I still do not know your name?"

# game/script.rpy:928
translate english b4_4b9a578b:

    # mc2 "我叫萧瑀，不过千万别叫小瑀，听起来太大众化了。"
    mc2 "My name is Xiao Yu, but you better not call me Little Yu, it's too common."

# game/script.rpy:930
translate english b4_0f31b960:

    # five "哈哈，姐姐姓萧，那我就叫你笑笑吧，这样算特别了吧？"
    five "Ha ha, Your surname is Xiao, how about I call you Xiao Xiao, which when transcribed phonetically, is associated with smiles. Is that unique enough?"

# game/script.rpy:932
translate english b4_69a5a90d:

    # mc2 "(有些不悦)太随意了吧"
    mc2 "(A bit unhappy) It is too casual."

# game/script.rpy:934
translate english b4_0260e3c0:

    # "听到这里，我转身准备离开。在桃花飘落的时候，五郎出乎意外地拉住了我的手腕。"
    "A little displeased, I decide to leave.  The petals continue to rain down when Wu Lang unexpectedly grabs my wrist."

# game/script.rpy:937
translate english b4_1eb98ef0:

    # five "姐姐面若桃花，眉清目秀，为何不多笑笑？(温柔地把我的发丝绕到耳后)"
    five "But you're so pretty. I daresay you're more endearing than the peach blossoms here."
    five "Why not smile more? (He gently brushes my hair to the back of my ear)"

# game/script.rpy:939
translate english b4_52bb58e8:

    # "五郎的神情似乎不像开玩笑，让我觉得有些奇怪。脸上的红晕更胜盛开的桃花。 "
    "Wu Lang doesn't seem to be joking. I think this is a bit strange. My flustered cheeks are even redder than the peach blossoms."

# game/script.rpy:941
translate english b4_e04496ae:

    # "当我回到店里，一位伙计就说有人找我。一位年少的男子坐在店里，抬头时，碰巧与我对视。"
    "When I get back inside, one of the staff tells me that someone is looking for me."
    "There is a young man sitting inside. When he lifts up his head, our eyes meet."

# game/script.rpy:943
translate english b4_5e33347a:

    # four "想必这位就是萧大小姐了吧？我家七弟不小心摔破了夫人的心爱之物,今日拜访一是为道歉，二是为了偿还那花瓶的费用的。"
    four "You must be Miss Xiao, correct? My little brother broke your mother's vase."
    four "I'm visiting for two reasons. One, is to apologize and two, to compensate."

# game/script.rpy:945
translate english b4_5e929338:

    # "真是奇怪，小七不是刚刚才把花瓶打破吗？这人怎么转眼间就知道了？"
    "This is so strange, didn't Xiao Qi just break the vase? How did this person find out so fast?"

# game/script.rpy:947
translate english b4_4c3f8f57:

    # mc2 "你是谁啊？报上名来。"
    mc2 "Who are you?"

# game/script.rpy:949
translate english b4_6b7df8bd:

    # four "在下家中排行第四，姑娘可以唤我四郎。"
    four "At home, I am the fourth son in line. Miss Xiao, you may call me Si Lang."

# game/script.rpy:951
translate english b4_69d25904:

    # mc2 "哦，那你要怎么赔罪啊？那花瓶价值连城，可是我祖母留下来的，就算你找了一个相似的赝品，我娘也不会消气。"
    mc2 "Oh, how do you plan to apologize? That vase is priceless. It was left behind by my great-grandmother. "
    mc2 " Even if you find a replica that looks the exact same as this vase, my mother will not accept it."

# game/script.rpy:953
translate english b4_5c2e328d:

    # four "不用担心，我有一样东西是夫人求之不得的宝物(拿出了一块石头)此乃女娲补天的灵石之一，它带有的灵性和福气足以让你们的酒店生意兴隆"
    four "No worries. I have an item that all mortals desperately crave. (Takes out a rock from his pocket) "
    four "After creating mankind, Goddess Nuwa used this rock to repair the pillar of Heaven. It's able to bring fortune and luck to this restaurant"

# game/script.rpy:955
translate english b4_e97c793f:

    # "这石头看起来平淡无奇，我觉得"
    "This rock looks old and plain, I think-"

# game/script.rpy:962
translate english b5_460efb5b:

    # mc2 "(想了想)谁知道是真是假啊？你说的也太玄乎了。(随手拿走了他腰间的玉佩)这个看起来比那破石头值钱，就把它留下来吧"
    mc2 "(Reflects on something) I can't verify what you said. It's all part of a myth. "
    mc2 "(Takes away his jade pendant) But this thing looks far more valuable than the rock. I'll keep this for you."

# game/script.rpy:964
translate english b5_66e032ce:

    # four "不行，这个不能给你。(不敢相信我的速度，有些吃惊)"
    four "No, you can't have this. (Surprised at how quick I was)"

# game/script.rpy:966
translate english b5_6d98fbe6:

    # "少年想抢走我手上的东西，奈何我提前把玉佩放进了胸前的衣衫里，他本来伸出来的手留在半空中，耳朵也比外面晚霞还要红"
    "Although the youth wants to take his pendant back, I slide it in my shirt, somewhere close to my chest. "
    "His hand suspends in mid-air, and he blushes so hard that it's comparable to the afterglow."

# game/script.rpy:968
translate english b5_6cbe10a0:

    # four "这是我母亲让我送给未来妻子的礼物，快还给我。"
    four "The jade pendant is supposed to be a gift to my future wife. Give it back."

# game/script.rpy:970
translate english b5_c4ee9ac1:

    # mc2 "现在不行，这破石头不知有没有用。你们跑了怎么办？六十天后，如果店的生意好了，我可以考虑还给你"
    mc2 "Not now. I have no use of that plain, old rock. What if you lie to me and run away? Wait for sixty days. If our business improves, then you can have the pendant back."

# game/script.rpy:971
translate english b5_1ea7c710:

    # four "我怎么知道你说的是不是实话？"
    four "How would I know if you're telling the truth?"

# game/script.rpy:973
translate english b5_7998e5cf:

    # mc2 "那你就留下来打工吧，包吃住，不过没工资。要是这石头真有用，你们就不用赔钱。"
    mc2 "Then stay in the restaurant to help us. I won't pay you but we'll offer you a place to stay and have food on the table."
    mc2 "If this rock proves its worth, then I'll clear your request of returning your pendant."

# game/script.rpy:975
translate english b5_01a6b374:

    # four "你看起来不像坏人。好，我就相信你一次。"
    four "You don't look like the type that lies. Alright, I will believe you for once."

# game/script.rpy:977
translate english b5_204df237:

    # "不敢相信我一天竟然找了两个伙计，我总觉得接下来有什么惊喜在等着我."
    "I can't believe that I've found two more workers for the restaurant. Now I really do think that something great is waiting for me."

# game/script.rpy:979
translate english b5_0a869417:

    # "早上到了，我准备先去找谁呢？"
    "As the next morning proceeds, who should I go talk to first?"

# game/script.rpy:983
translate english b5_e5367d4d:

    # "我轻轻地敲了敲門，里面却迟迟没有答复。我听到后院有些动静便移身到了后院。"
    "I gently knock on the front door, yet no one responds. After hearing some commotions in the backyard, I decide to check it out first."

# game/script.rpy:985
translate english b5_a1949e7e:

    # "到了后院，我看到四郎已经早起并且在练习剑术。他的招式看起来变化多端，出手不凡。已经练习到炉火纯青的地步了。"
    "As I stop by the backyard, I see the fourth brother has already gotten up and practiced with his sword."
    "A great swordsman, he seems to be experienced and knows what he's doing."

# game/script.rpy:986
translate english b5_73fbc2d3:

    # four "（收起宝剑）姑娘，可有事找我？"
    four "(Puts his sword back in scabbard) Oh, are you looking for me?"


# game/script.rpy:988
translate english b5_b8bf81bf:

    # mc2 "哦，早餐已经做好了。反正以后都会在酒楼经常见面，就叫我萧瑀吧。（递给他一篮水果）厨子说希望你帮他洗洗水果，这个是今天我们晚上的点心。"
    mc2 "Um, yeah. Breakfast is ready. We'll get to see each other a lot in the next few months, why don't you call me by my name - Xiaoyu?"

# game/script.rpy:989
translate english b5_591d0388:

    # mc2 "（想起什么）你和你的弟弟们出门在外，是否需要向家里寄封书信？六十天还很长哦。"
    mc2 "(Thought about something) Do you need to write letters to your parents? They must be worried about you guys. Sixty days can be a long time."

# game/script.rpy:991
translate english b5_7f1b401b:

    # four "（接过水果）姑娘不必担心，我与弟弟们常年都在外修行，六十天转眼就过去了。之前，我一直都在九华山随师尊修行，父母也只是偶尔问候。"
    four "(Takes the basket) No worries, sixty days will pass by in a blink of a second. My brothers and I left home to practice cultivation."
    four "For as long as I can remember, I have been staying with my teacher in Mount Jiuhua. My parents seldomly visit me."

# game/script.rpy:992
translate english b5_637db4c5:

    # mc2 "我和我爹娘可是天天见面，偶尔问候的话，你不想念他们吗？"
    mc2 "Oh, is that so? I always get to see my parents. If they only visit you from time to time, do you miss them?"

# game/script.rpy:993
translate english b5_c6ce51f0:

    # four "怎能不想？ 若是我要探望双亲，弹指之间，就能相见。倒是弟弟们一直潜心修行，所以我已经很久未和他们见面了。这次我在九华山知道了这件事，就马上赶过来了。"
    four "Of course, I do. If I want to visit them, it can be done in a matter of seconds."
    four "Actually, I haven't seen my brothers for a long time because we all have different teachers and grandmasters. "
    four "As soon as I found out about the vase incident, I came to visit them."

# game/script.rpy:994
translate english b5_61989689:

    # mc2 "你的意思是你父母也住在九华山吧？那里人烟稀少，可不比京都热闹。"
    mc2 "Hmmm, you mean like your parents also live in Mount Jiuhua, right? Not many people reside there, so I guess the capital city is a lot more fun. "

# game/script.rpy:995
translate english b5_bfa3df96:

    # mc2 "西凉这么大，京都离九华山这么远，你也千里迢迢赶过来见你弟弟们？（摇摇头）不对，九华山没听说有什么高人啊，那里算命的都挺少。"
    mc2 "It should've taken you days to get here. (Shakes my head) Wait a minute, who's your teacher?"

# game/script.rpy:997
translate english b5_00055675:

    # four "（一本正经，脱口而出）何出此言，师尊乃是地藏王菩萨，自然是高人。"
    four "(A matter of fact)  My teacher is the great Ksitigarbha, the bodhisattva of the underworld."
    four "He's able to reach nirvana, yet out of compassion, he chooses to stay in Hell to save other beings. "

# game/script.rpy:999
translate english b5_ea8c7334:

    # mc2 "（手拂过他的额头）没发烧啊，可怎么病的不轻？脑子没事吧？"
    mc2 "(presses my hand on his forehead to check the temperature) You mean your teacher is one of the four most important bodhisattvas in Buddhism?"
    mc2 "You didn't catch a fever, but you must be sick to say something like this."

# game/script.rpy:1001
translate english b5_d470aff1:

    # four "（微微一怔，移开我的手，嘀咕）恻隐之心，人皆有之。姑娘虽与我只有几面之缘，却有慈悲心，一定也和佛有缘。"
    four "(Startled, gently removes my hand) Mankind is gifted with the ability to sympathize. Although we've just met, you are already capable of showing compassion."
    four "A kind person like you must have an affinity with Buddhism."

# game/script.rpy:1002
translate english b5_e10a635f:

    # mc2 "姐姐我可是立志要成为京都第一小富婆的女人，佛可跟我无缘。红尘里有金钱，我才没有那么清心寡欲呢。（叹气）以后跟着姐姐我赚钱，攒够了，就找大夫看看。"
    mc2 "Affinity? Perhaps not. I want to be the richest woman in the capital city, so Buddhism doesn't attract me. Wealth is way more important to me than reaching enlightenment. "
    mc2 "(Sighs) Just work for my family restaurant for now, once you earn enough money, you should go see a doctor."

# game/script.rpy:1003
translate english b5_3cb85e9f:

    # four "七郎说你心地善良，可惜还是迷恋凡尘的身外之物。师尊曾立誓解救众生，既然我已离开九华山，我亦想传承师尊的信念。萧姑娘，我会渡你过苦海和轮回。"
    four "My seventh brother, Qi Lang, said you're a kind woman. Unfortunately, money and greed will not help you reach enlightenment. "
    four "My master has taught me to put others before myself, although I've already left mount Jiuhua, I will remain faithful to the cause."
    four "Miss Xiao, I wish to be your guide, so you will avoid the wheel of reincarnation and suffering in the afterlife. "

# game/script.rpy:1004
translate english b5_cbcc9ef2:

    # mc2 "（摇摇头）是不是早上没睡醒？谁不迷恋红尘啊？就连你以后都要找未婚妻吧？去吃早餐吧。"
    mc2 "(Shake my head) Hmm, you have no place to tell me what to do. We all gotta live for something, be it love or wealth."
    mc2 "As long as our desire exists, it's gonna be hard to reach nirvana. You'll get married one day too, right? Anyways, you should get breakfast now"

# game/script.rpy:1005
translate english b5_d0cea763:

    # four "（点了点头）我马上就来前厅。"
    four "(nods) Just a moment, I will be with you guys soon."

# game/script.rpy:1009
translate english b5_6b0f4810:

    # "我在門外敲了许久，奈何没人回应。这小子难道是跑路了？想到这里，我踹开了門。他原来还在睡觉！"
    "I stand by the door for a long time, but no one responds. Did the fifth brother run away? "
    "Unsure of what might have happened, I kick the door open. What! He's still in bed!"

# game/script.rpy:1011
translate english b5_09137bf6:

    # mc2 "五郎，我们酒楼就要开业了，你快起来啦(坐在床边)"
    mc2 "Wu Lang(Fifth brother), you need to get up for work. We're opening today. (Sit by his bedside)"

# game/script.rpy:1012
translate english b5_25bf685c:

    # five "不行，让我再睡一觉。昨天晚上我四哥可没少给我说教。早些时日，我在南海修炼就要天天早起，好不容易出来了，我要多睡久点。"
    five "No, just give me five more minutes. My fourth brother gave me a whole lecture last night"

# game/script.rpy:1013
translate english b5_7c774cf0:

    # mc2 "起来晚了可是没早餐吃的。你要早睡早起。(把他拉起来，他却低头倒在了我的肩膀上)"
    mc2 "You won't get to eat anything if you don't get up on time. And you shouldn't have stayed up so late (grabs him by the hand, yet his head collapses on my shoulder)"

# game/script.rpy:1015
translate english b5_0ce7c7df:

    # five "(勉强睁开眼睛)你是抹了桃花香味的胭脂水粉吗？(呆呆地笑了笑)"
    five "(tries to open his eyes) Oh, the scent of peach blossom. Your perfume lasts forever. (a silly smile)"

# game/script.rpy:1016
translate english b5_e0963bc3:

    # "看来把他叫醒只有一个办法了"
    "I guess there's only one way to wake him up."

# game/script.rpy:1017
translate english b5_c3283383:

    # mc2 "诶？五郎你怎么看起来和你那个拿石子砸我的三哥有些像？"
    mc2 "Hey, Wu Lang, why do you look just like your third brother?"

# game/script.rpy:1019
translate english b5_ce129b51:

    # five "五郎下意识地摸了摸自己的脸，转了过去，似乎很害怕我已经发现他的秘密。看来我可以出去看看了。"
    five "Subconsciously, he turns his head away while touching his cheeks, as if I just discovered a deep secret about him. I guess now is the time to go out."

# game/script.rpy:1024
translate english b6_9260cd6f:

    # "我娘的一个远方表亲突然来到客栈投靠我们，我爹娘没拒绝他，所以现在我那位表叔暂时监督酒楼的生意和伙计们。"
    "A distant relative from my mom's side visits us this morning. My parents let him stay, so he's in charge of supervising our business progress."

# game/script.rpy:1026
translate english b6_fe7ad311:

    # "这位表叔手不能劈柴，三不五十就去厨房拿个点心吃。看起来挺悠哉的"
    "Not only he refuses to do actual work, but also he's constantly eating our food. He looks relaxed most of the time."

# game/script.rpy:1028
translate english b6_741f1a9a:

    # b "哟，我看你们这个馒头蒸的还可以啊。下次能煎馒头，特好吃！"
    b "Oh, steamed buns! How lovely. Next time you guys should stir fry them. They're so good!"

# game/script.rpy:1030
translate english b6_ff72f1d5:

    # five "这可是张厨子早起擀的面，能不好吃吗？"
    five "Well, chef Zhang woke up early to knead the dough, of course it's good."

# game/script.rpy:1032
translate english b6_2af2fa2f:

    # b "这是谁啊？怎么没见过？"
    b "Who is he? Never seen him before."

# game/script.rpy:1034
translate english b6_bd4e4647:

    # mc2 "他是新来的伙计，五郎。他的哥哥，四郎，也在这儿和我一起跑堂。"
    mc2 "He's a new guy. Wu Lang and his brother, Si Lang, work for us."

# game/script.rpy:1036
translate english b6_d49967b7:

    # b "（悠哉的掰开橘子）嗯，年轻人还是不能打闹，要多做事，少说话。那厨房还有苹果吗？谁切一盘出来呀。"
    b "(Peels an orange) Hmm, you young folks shouldn't play around, always do work, talk less. "
    b "Do you guys still have apples? Someone should cut more fruits."

# game/script.rpy:1038
translate english b6_a204a87f:

    # "表叔毕竟是长辈，这时只有娘出来说他。 毕竟他也无所事事这么久了，来这个店之后就出了一张嘴。"
    "This relative whom I kindly call uncle hasn't really contributed anything since his arrival. Maybe only my mom can say something to him."

# game/script.rpy:1040
translate english b6_7e02f177:

    # mom "不是有手有脚吗，咋的不自己切水果呀？"
    mom "You've got hands and feet. Why don't you help yourself?"

# game/script.rpy:1042
translate english b6_016f97e9:

    # b "我一路奔波劳累啊。我苦啊。这种小事也让我做？"
    b "I've been through so much to get here. I'm too tired to think of doing something so trivial."

# game/script.rpy:1044
translate english b6_4f11a677:

    # mc2 "（开始不耐烦了）谁爱吃谁切，反正我不切。"
    mc2 "(Annoyed) Well, I'm not cutting anything for anybody."

# game/script.rpy:1046
translate english b6_b473c8cd:

    # b "(试探）那厨子去切吧。"
    b "Maybe the chef can help."

# game/script.rpy:1048
translate english b6_e78a2a5a:

    # "张厨子当做没听到，继续吃饭，还特地去厨房添一碗饭才坐回来。"
    "Chef Zhang pretends as if he didn't hear him. He intentionally goes to the kitchen to add an extra bowl of white rice"

# game/script.rpy:1050
translate english b6_71f7ea17:

    # mom "哎，还是给他切一盘水果吧。这回他落榜了，难免心情不好。晚辈的去切吧。这时我要看向谁?"
    mom "Come on, someone should help him. He failed his exam, so he's been really down. One of you young kids should help"

# game/script.rpy:1055
translate english b6_e24b2e72:

    # four "这不是你孝顺的好机会吗？"
    four "Isn't this an opportunity for you to show some filial piety?"

# game/script.rpy:1057
translate english b6_b68559f1:

    # mc2 "你初来乍到该给表叔留个好映象才对。我娘说过会切水果的男人，一定很心善。"
    mc2 "Well, you just got here. It's your chance to leave a good impression. My mom said guys who know how to cut fruits must be really nice."

# game/script.rpy:1059
translate english b6_dc906bc2:

    # four "还有呢？"
    four "And?"

# game/script.rpy:1060
translate english b6_89c4bd1f:

    # mc2 "那个人一定心胸宽广，总之就是一个彬彬有礼的人吧"
    mc2 "He must be really kind too, good manners, and everyone wants to be around with someone like that."

# game/script.rpy:1061
translate english b6_0fb0d803:

    # four "(点点头)你都这么说了，我怎么有不去的道理"
    four "(nods) If you insist, then there's no reason for me not to go. I'll cut the apples with my sword."

# game/script.rpy:1063
translate english b6_59f0b331:

    # mom "（看着四郎走远的身影）我什么时候说过这个话了?"
    mom "(Looks at Si Lang from the back) Since when did I say that?"

# game/script.rpy:1065
translate english b6_c266fa7e:

    # mc2 "（端起茶杯）就当今天说的吧。"
    mc2 "(Raises a cup of tea) Today."

# game/script.rpy:1066
translate english b6_8c5ee2e8:

    # mom "（捂着嘴笑）这个少年还不错"
    mom "(Chuckles) He's a great guy, huh."

# game/script.rpy:1070
translate english b6_eae759af:

    # five "(用手遮住视线)别看着我，我不去，我昨天开始就失眠了。"
    five "Whoa, don't look at me. I'm not gonna go. I haven't gotten enough sleep since last night."

# game/script.rpy:1071
translate english b6_8bb0bce9:

    # mc2 "你确定？厨房里还有一些清茶，最适合让你提神的了。去吧，免得等一下在厨房犯困，切到手就不好了。"
    mc2 "Are you sure? Well, there's some tea in the kitchen that will make you feel better."
    mc2 "You should go. What if you accidentally cut yourself when helping the chef?"

# game/script.rpy:1073
translate english b6_fa199daa:

    # five "看在你这么关心我的份上，好吧。不就是去厨房吗?"
    five "Hmmm. You seem to be caring. Alright, I'll go. It's just cutting fruits in the kitchen, no big deal."

# game/script.rpy:1077
translate english b7_b97fe6f8:

    # "表叔接过水果盘，并未道谢。摇了摇头，又叹了口气。"
    "My uncle doesn't say thanks when he receives the fruits. Shaking his head, he sighs."

# game/script.rpy:1078
translate english b7_fb0873b2:

    # b "这苹果不甜啊。（盯着店里的装潢）你们这儿早就该整顿了。桌子太矮，椅子太旧，墙壁也该重刷了吧?"
    b "This apple isn't sweet. (Looks at our furniture) And this place needs to be refurbished. "
    b "Tables are too low, chairs too old, and walls need to be repainted."

# game/script.rpy:1080
translate english b7_50b94b32:

    # four "店里的厨具不够，而且好几样东西都生锈了。"
    four "We don't have enough kitchen supplies, and most of them got rust all over them."

# game/script.rpy:1082
translate english b7_c41e28ac:

    # b "买，元宵节会来这么多的客人，我们都要留住。若是客人来自外国我们还得打折呢。"
    b "Then we need to buy new ones. The lantern festival is in a few days, we need to keep all the customers."
    b "If they come from overseas, then we should give them a discount."

# game/script.rpy:1084
translate english b7_19ac8139:

    # four "（喝了一口清茶）可是店里的桌子，椅子可能也会不够了。"
    four "(Sips tea) But we won't have enough chairs and desks for all of them."

# game/script.rpy:1086
translate english b7_a5dd65e1:

    # b "买，买，买，这些都要买。 店面不够，我们就买地。菜不够，我们自己在后院种。鸡鸭鱼不够，我们就自己开农场。"
    b "Then buy more chairs and desks. If our restaurant is too small, then we buy more land. If we're out of veggies, then we grow some in the backyard."
    b "If we don't have enough livestock, then we should start a ranch!"

# game/script.rpy:1088
translate english b7_1ac21d27:

    # "四郎非常疑惑地看了看表叔，可是却迟迟没有开口。"
    "Si Lang looks at my uncle like he's a questionable man, but he hesitates on making any comment."

# game/script.rpy:1091
translate english b7_ccc35232:

    # "吃完早餐，我准备去市集买些胭脂，刚出店，我又发现了前几天的那个奇怪少年。"
    "After breakfast, I decide to head out the restaurant and get some make-up from the market. Just as I step out the door, I meet the same guy from a few days ago"

# game/script.rpy:1092
translate english b7_0f14a742:

    # "那个陌生男子还是一如既往的沉默又不失礼貌地向我微笑。他这是要进店吗?"
    "He smiles again, seemingly polite. Is he gonna go in?"

# game/script.rpy:1094
translate english b7_673e6877:

    # "见他未动，我准备绕过他直接去另外一条路，谁知道他突然揽着我的腰并且一瞬间我们竟然到了其它地方。"
    "He does not stir. I decide to take another path instead. Unexpected, he leans in and grabs me by the waist. In a few seconds, we're in a totally different place."

# game/script.rpy:1096
translate english b7_2bbe297a:

    # dude7 "就是你把我的三个弟弟拐到你们那间酒楼的吧?"
    dude7 "So you are the one who kidnapped my brothers."

# game/script.rpy:1098
translate english b7_7c781f91:

    # mc2 "你。。你是谁啊?"
    mc2 "Who are you?"

# game/script.rpy:1100
translate english b7_032fb24e:

    # dude7 "（似乎没听到我的话）你每日都让我的弟弟们干那些苦活，我应该怎么感谢你才好呢？"
    dude7 "(As if he didn't hear me) You've demanded my brothers to do a lot of hard work at your restaurant. How should I express my gratitude?"

# game/script.rpy:1102
translate english b7_12d0b3cd:

    # "虽然我不知道这少年的性格，不过此人绝对不是善茬。"
    "Although I don't really know who he is, this guy gives off an evil vibe."

# game/script.rpy:1104
translate english b7_dc8a03b4:

    # "当我回过神来，我发现那个白衣男子原来把我掳到了一个山洞里。 这个人绝对会什么邪术。"
    "Before I can recollect myself, the youth in white has already kidnapped me against my will. He must know some sort of dark magic."

# game/script.rpy:1107
translate english b7_3beb2133:

    # mc2 "你到底是谁啊，我可不记得得罪过你。"
    mc2 "Who are you? I don't remember offending someone like you before."

# game/script.rpy:1109
translate english b7_ab642ffc:

    # dude7 "你真的不知道？四郎和五郎没有向你提起他们的身份吗？"
    dude7 "Are you playing dumb? Don't you know about Si Lang and Wu Lang's other identity?"

# game/script.rpy:1111
translate english b7_cc67f0fb:

    # mc2 "他们什么身份管我什么事？他们两个刚来店里不久，只要把店里的事打点好就够了。我才不会那么无聊，问他们其余的事。"
    mc2 "What has their identity to do with me? They just got hired, and all I care about is having enough people to work for the restaurant."
    mc2 "I have no interest in knowing their other identities."

# game/script.rpy:1113
translate english b7_b6e0468c:

    # dude7 "我是他们的三哥，人称三郎。既然你还什么都不知道，那现在不必告诉你我的名号。"
    dude7 "I am their third brother, and most people refer to me as San Lang. If you don't know anything yet, then I'm not obligated to disclose my title to you."

# game/script.rpy:1115
translate english b7_d7d4e901:

    # mc2 "你要什么时候才能放我出去？"
    mc2 "When are you gonna let me go?"

# game/script.rpy:1117
translate english b7_a972f668:

    # three "只要你向我三个弟弟诚恳地道歉，你随时都可以回家。"
    three "As soon as you apologize to all three of my brothers."

# game/script.rpy:1119
translate english b7_667e5745:

    # mc2 "姐姐我为什么突然要向他们道歉啊？"
    mc2 "Why should I apologize to them?"

# game/script.rpy:1121
translate english b7_c64d1537:

    # three "明知故问。若不是你使了什么手段，他们怎么会愿意在一家酒楼做事？"
    three "You must have used some trick so they stayed in the restaurant to work for your family business."

# game/script.rpy:1123
translate english b7_6f547d79:

    # mc2 "(翻了一个白眼)胡说八道。那是他们自愿的。我懒得跟你说。(走向洞口)"
    mc2 "(Rolls my eyes) I didn't force them to stay. It's all voluntary."
    mc2 " I don't have time to explain every little detail to you. (Walks to the entrance of the cave)"

# game/script.rpy:1125
translate english b7_d3710bb0:

    # three "(摇摇头)既然这样，你就在这里好好反省一下吧。这洞口外面可是有一只白色的老虎，它三天没吃东西了。如果你不怕死的话，就自己出去吧。"
    three "Is that so? You should stay here and give some time to reflect on yourself. A white tiger is lingering around this cave. "
    three "He hasn't eaten anything for three days. If you feel brave enough to step out, then you may go alone."

# game/script.rpy:1128
translate english b7_11aeafec:

    # "虽然我表面上看起来非常镇定，可是当我真的看到了那只白虎时，我的理智战胜了勇气。"
    "Although I look very composed, when I actually see the white tiger, my reasoning outweighs that bravery."

# game/script.rpy:1130
translate english b7_0f4606a1:

    # three "诶？怎么回来了？外面的空气不是更清爽吗？"
    three "Oh, why are you back? I thought the air outside was fresher?"

# game/script.rpy:1132
translate english b7_42e45a0d:

    # mc2 "哼，要你管啊。(眼睛转了转)笨蛋说什么啊？"
    mc2 "Pshht. It's none of your business. (rolls eyes) Dummy says what?"

# game/script.rpy:1134
translate english b7_c4ce8162:

    # three "(有些疑惑)什么？"
    three "(Confused) What?"

# game/script.rpy:1136
translate english b7_f305c03f:

    # mc2 "哈哈，果然是一个笨蛋。姐姐我是不会被你打败的。"
    mc2 "Haha, you're such a dummy. I'm not gonna let you win. I'm not gonna apologize for something I didn't do."

# game/script.rpy:1138
translate english b7_f7509f64:

    # three "幼稚。时间不早了，我也该走了。(递给我一张纸和笔)如果你想通了，就用这个毛笔写一个\"和\"字"
    three "That's very childish of you. Anyways, it's getting late. I should leave now. "
    three "(Passes me some writing utensils) If you feel like giving up, just write \“peace\” on this paper."

# game/script.rpy:1140
translate english b7_0560dfc3:

    # "话音刚落，这少年就在白烟缭绕中消失了。他的衣着几乎全白，他手上的那根红绳倒是显得有些显眼。"
    "As soon as he finishes this sentence, he disappears in the midair. He dresses in all white, which makes the red string on his wrist stand out."

# game/script.rpy:1142
translate english b7_97472d95:

    # "难道他手上的红线是用来求姻缘的？这人这么难相处，我估计就算红线缠满了手腕都不会有女孩子喜欢上他吧。"
    "I know there's an association between red strings and love life. Some people wear red strings to attract others, or in the hope of pursuing romances."
    "But this guy is so difficult to be around with. Even if he wears thirty strings on each of his wrists, I bet no girl will fall in love with him."
# game/script.rpy:1144
translate english b7_543dc715:

    # "坐在山洞里，我的肚子开始饿的有些疼了，可是奈何洞口外的白虎还是没有离开。"
    "Time passes by as I stay in the cave, I'm getting hungry, but the white tiger still hasn't left yet."

# game/script.rpy:1146
translate english b7_2c317d4e:

    # "洞口的光越来越薄弱，不知为何，我突然想到了我的爹娘。如果我真的不能回家了，他们会不会也很想我呢？"
    "Daylight is slowly diminishing, and I start to miss my parents already. If I don't return home tonight, will they miss me too?"

# game/script.rpy:1148
translate english b7_abd982eb:

    # "我看了一眼白衣男子留下来的纸和笔，我决定"
    "As I look at the piece of white paper and pen, I decide to-"

# game/script.rpy:1151
translate english b7_51ad5cbd:

    # "想让我屈服？不可能。忍耐着饥饿，我写下了一个字—'善'"
    "This guy really wants me to give up, but I'm not going to. Despite hunger, I write down a word on the paper- \“Virtue\”."

# game/script.rpy:1154
translate english b7_3caf869e:

    # "不管怎么样，我是不会屈服的，我就不信没有其它办法。"
    "No matter what, I will not give in. There's gotta be another way."

# game/script.rpy:1157
translate english b8_16d412d9:

    # "我的脑子有些昏沉的感觉，看来我不能这么坐以待毙下去了。我可不想死在这里。我走到了洞口不远处，奇怪的是这次的白虎右手上系了红绳"
    "My mind starts to get a bit groggy. I cannot continue to sit here and do nothing. I do not want to die here."
    "I walk close to the cave entrance. Strangely this time, a red string is tied around the white tiger's right paw."

# game/script.rpy:1159
translate english b8_a4ee99e6:

    # "最初见到的那只白虎似乎没有这个红绳子，难道是幻术吗？"
    "Did the white tiger have that red string when I first saw it? Could this be an illusion?"

# game/script.rpy:1161
translate english b8_adfeb892:

    # "可能是我的求生欲超过了我的预期，我拿着洞口旁的树枝直接冲向了白虎。"
    "Maybe my desire to live has surpassed my expectations. I pick up a stick next to the cave and charge directly at the white tiger."

# game/script.rpy:1163
translate english b8_e15d9e15:

    # "这白虎刚开始并不在意我的出现，后来我出其不意地等它转过头，直降在它的身后，将锋利的树枝插入它的背上。"
    "At first, the white tiger does not care about my presence. I wait for it to turn its head and then attack it from behind."
    "I pierce his back with the sharp end of the stick."

# game/script.rpy:1166
translate english b8_34957aa6:

    # "顿时，它的吼叫声穿过了整个山谷，惊天动地。"
    "It let out a roar loud enough to pass through the entire valley and shakes the earth."

# game/script.rpy:1168
translate english b8_51fab347:

    # "我明白这个力度往往不够直接让它致命，于是我骑在白虎的背上，把那树根刺的更深。"
    "I know I didn't make fatal damage, so I ride on the white tiger's back and thrust the branch deeper."

# game/script.rpy:1171
translate english b8_1480bc32:

    # "这凶兽似乎被我彻底激怒了，它急切地把我摔下， 抓伤了我的肩，我感觉我身上的瘀青肯定不少。它发出的一阵嘶吼直接把我手上的树根震动掉落在地面。"
    "The beast is now completely furious at me.  It rapidly throws me off and scratches my shoulder. "
    "I feel like my body is covered with bruises. It let out a direct roar, which shakes the branch out of my hand."

# game/script.rpy:1173
translate english b8_93e420a8:

    # "周围的树木似乎一一开始枯萎， 鸟儿也像受了惊吓一般飞走了。转眼间，这白虎的爪子似乎要向我扑来,我用了最后的力气站起来，准备"
    "The surrounding trees start to wither one by one, and the birds are all frightened away. In a blink of an eye, the white tiger scratches me again. I  decide to."

# game/script.rpy:1179
translate english b8_de46435a:

    # "奈何这绳子完全不动，于是我用尽全力咬住了它的脖子。"
    "However, the string did not move at all. So I used all my strength and bit its neck."

# game/script.rpy:1185
translate english b9_b87451b7:

    # "闭上眼睛,我想这可能是我活在世上最后的片刻了吧。奇怪的是这白虎的脖子怎么感觉这么嫩滑?"
    "Closing my eyes, I assume this is my last moment in this world. but why is the white tiger's neck so tender?"

# game/script.rpy:1187
translate english b9_e7581f0d:

    # "除了血迹的味道，我似乎还闻到了桃花瓣的清香."
    "Aside from the scent of blood I faintly sense the presence of peach blossoms."

# game/script.rpy:1189
translate english b9_d1a8dfa5:

    # "慢慢睁开眼睛，我发现我的手原来抓着那白衣少年的手臂，嘴唇还停留在他的颈旁。双双坠落在地上，我们身上的衣衫也紧密地贴在了一起。"
    "Slowly opening my eyes, I see my hand on his arm. My lips are still on his neck."
    "We both fall to the ground and we're so close that look as if our clothes are sticked together."

# game/script.rpy:1191
translate english b9_6370519e:

    # "刹那间，气氛似乎变得有些奇特. 不知是他肌肤的温度 还是我们的距离带给了我一丝温暖的情意。"
    "In that instance, the atmosphere becomes different. I don't know if it's his body temperature or our close distance that is bringing me some warmth."

# game/script.rpy:1193
translate english b9_315c0435:

    # "到底是什么情感竟然把我身上的那些痛楚全部消散掉了？又是什么原因让我的恐惧转变为羞涩？"
    "What kind of emotion is this? It takes away the once intolerable pain from my body, and replaces all of my fears with shyness."

# game/script.rpy:1195
translate english b9_7bc50677:

    # "这一刻还存在的心悸是否在下一秒就会像山谷里的白雾慢慢消散？还是会像山下的青草一样生生不息？"
    "Will my feelings dissipate like the white mist in the valley just in a few seconds? Or will it continue to grow like the grasses below the mountains?"

# game/script.rpy:1197
translate english b9_f68431e4:

    # "他身上似乎完全没有了杀气， 剩下来的只有噗通的心跳声，不知为何他竟然还没有推开我。"
    "There is no more murderous aura in him. All that was left was the pounding heartbeats. Somehow, he hasn't pushed me away"

# game/script.rpy:1199
translate english b9_da1f5ef2:

    # "他突然起身，我发现他的脸和脖子都布满了红晕。此情此景，我的脸也慢慢发烫。"
    "He suddenly gets up. I notice his face and neck are flushed red. In this situation, my face is slowly getting hot."

# game/script.rpy:1201
translate english b9_96187e0c:

    # dude7 "怎么还不起来?"
    dude7 "Why are you not getting up?"

# game/script.rpy:1203
translate english b9_f4ad97c4:

    # "白衣少年似乎并不打算帮我，我准备"
    "It doesn't seem like the youth in white will help me. I decide to-"

# game/script.rpy:1209
translate english b9_f67e401e:

    # "好像没什么用，看来是时候展示我的演技了"
    "Seems a bit useless, I think it is time to show my acting skills"

# game/script.rpy:1213
translate english b10_00d844a6:

    # mc2 "眼泪汪汪)我今天只吃了早饭，现在还伤痕累累，我娘要知道了，一定会心疼的。"
    mc2 "(Teary eyes) I've only had breakfast this morning and now I am wounded. If my mother knew it would break her heart."

# game/script.rpy:1215
translate english b10_58052859:

    # three "方才咬人的时候怎么不见你无力可使?"
    three "Where is that power that you bit me with?"

# game/script.rpy:1217
translate english b10_ce119fc1:

    # mc2 "（挤出眼泪）我们家上有60多岁的老母，下有未成年的弟弟，我表叔现在染了恶疾，店里的伙计都快走光啦，你就可怜可怜我一下吧"
    mc2 "(Forcing tears out)  My elderly mother is over the age of 60 and I have a very young brother at home. "
    mc2 "My uncle is suffering from a terminal illness and all the staff at my restaurant have left. Can't you please show me some sympathy?"

# game/script.rpy:1219
translate english b10_abf23d36:

    # three "（把我抱起来）你娘不是才四十有余吗？而且你确定你不是独生女？"
    three "(picks me up) Isn't your mother just over 40? Are you sure you are not an only child?"

# game/script.rpy:1221
translate english b10_64d53ab7:

    # mc2 "(微微一笑)随便听听就好，干嘛那么认真啊？你的伤势怎么都已经愈和了?"
    mc2 "(slightly smiles) Does it matter if it's true or not?  Don't be too serious. Are all your wounds healed up already?"

# game/script.rpy:1223
translate english b10_c8445f60:

    # three "我的体质和凡人不同，自然是恢复的很快。你刚刚不是有沾到我的血吗？你现在之所以疲惫是因为我的血里有毒。"
    three "My physique is different from mortals, so I can recover quickly. Didn't you have some of my blood on you? You feel tired right now because my blood is poisonous."

# game/script.rpy:1225
translate english b10_93de2973:

    # mc2 "（咳咳，吐出舌头）你这人怎么血里有毒啊?"
    mc2 "(coughing, sticking out tongue) Why is your blood poisonous?"

# game/script.rpy:1227
translate english b10_7ab6b242:

    # three "（想到了什么）很多年前的事了。我带你先去去解毒，不过你必须答应我两件事。"
    three "(Thought of something) It happened many years ago. Come, let's get you the antidote, but you must promise me two things."

# game/script.rpy:1229
translate english b10_ea432e76:

    # mc2 "（双手从他的脖子下垂落，抱着自己的肩上）你。。你不会想让我答应你什么奇怪的要求吧?"
    mc2 "(Both hands loosen from his neck and clutch onto myself) You...you're not trying to take advantage of me, right?"

# game/script.rpy:1231
translate english b10_2f41ce88:

    # three "（皱眉）你在想什么乱七八糟的啊？想必你已经发现我不是凡人，我的真身乃是四灵中的白虎，人称陵光神君。"
    three "(Frowning) What nonsense are you thinking? Presumably, you have figured out that I am not a mortal."
    three "My real form is the white tiger of the four spirits. They call me, JianBing Shenjun"

# game/script.rpy:1233
translate english b10_8b735ce9:

    # mc2 "哦，白虎不是应该保佑着我们西凉的边界吗？你怎么在这个荒凉的山谷里？"
    mc2 "Oh, Isn't the white tiger supposed to be protecting our (country)Xiliang's border? Why are you in this desolate valley?"

# game/script.rpy:1235
translate english b10_2f6f4a33:

    # three "总之你要答应我不能和任何人提起我和我弟弟们的身份，也不可以让任何人知道我们使用过仙术。"
    three "In short, you need to swear that you will never mention my brothers' and my true identities to anyone, and.our abilities to use magic will remain secrets."

# game/script.rpy:1237
translate english b10_91e1825a:

    # mc2 "可我的肩和背都被你弄伤了。"
    mc2 "But you've injured my shoulder and back."

# game/script.rpy:1239
translate english b10_4244d7a5:

    # three "还不是因为你突然袭击我（想到什么）不过你竟然没有被我的爪子抓到后直接丧命，看来你很有可能有异于常人的根骨。"
    three "It's because you suddenly attacked me. (Thought of something) But since you didn't die instantly from my claws, it seems like you may not be just a simple mortal."

# game/script.rpy:1241
translate english b10_a68a8707:

    # mc2 "好吧，不过你要先把我治好才行。我们酒楼还要营业呢。"
    mc2 "Fine, but first you need to heal me. Our restaurant still needs to stay open."

# game/script.rpy:1243
translate english b10_58c11ae2:

    # three "都这个时候了还想着赚钱？你还是先担心一下自己的伤势吧."
    three "At this time you are still thinking about money? You should worry about yourself first."

# game/script.rpy:1245
translate english b10_ea07c08e:

    # three "我带你去见一个人，他一定能把你的伤治好。"
    three "I'll bring you to see someone, he will surely heal you."

# game/script.rpy:1247
translate english b10_453da493:

    # mc2 "你们神仙不是一个法术就能救活人吗?"
    mc2 "Don't celestial beings have magic that can resurrect the dead?"

# game/script.rpy:1249
translate english b10_cdf87a4d:

    # three "你身上的伤太重了，必须需要用仙界的药草才能治好。我好些年没回天宫了，身上的丹药早就所剩无几了。"
    three "Your injury is too severe, you need to use magical herbs only found in the Heavens. "
    three "I haven't returned to the Heavenly Realm for many years, all the medicine I brought with me is mostly used up."

# game/script.rpy:1251
translate english b10_5eca155a:

    # mc2 "可是我身上好像没那么疼了，这又是为什么?"
    mc2 "But I do not seem to feel much of the pain anymore. Why is that?"

# game/script.rpy:1253
translate english b10_6d5f5fb7:

    # three "（有些得意）上古时期，我可是四灵中的战神，所以就算被那个人暗算之后，我身上的灵力还是把他的毒化解为麻醉的液体。"
    three "(Proudly) In ancient times, I was the god of war among the four spirits. So even after being conspired by my enemy, my spiritual power turned the poison into a paralyzing liquid."

# game/script.rpy:1255
translate english b10_aff764b5:

    # three "虽然毒性还在，可是我已经对它免疫了。你之所以没有疼痛的感觉是因为我的血除了毒性还带有麻醉的功效。"
    three "Although the toxin is still there I have built an immunity to it. The reason why you cannot feel the pain anymore is that my blood has an anesthetic effect along with the poison."

# game/script.rpy:1257
translate english b10_9082f550:

    # mc2 "啊？那个人竟然可以伤你？他/她还不是很厉害？"
    mc2 "What? That person was about to hurt you? They must be really strong"

# game/script.rpy:1259
translate english b10_765505e7:

    # three "我最后一次见他早已是上古时期了。而天界有两个人应该可以制服他。"
    three "The last time I saw him was during Ancient times. Now there are two people in Heaven that can subdue him."

# game/script.rpy:1261
translate english b10_8e6068c4:

    # mc2 "谁啊?"
    mc2 "Who?"

# game/script.rpy:1263
translate english b10_1e692f09:

    # three "一是忘尘仙子，可惜她因为犯了事，早已不在天界。二是凌天玄女，她的灵力和忘尘仙子不分上下。"
    three "First is Goddess Wangchen, but she was exiled from Heaven after she committed a crime."
    three "The second is Ling Tian Xuan Nu, her spiritual power is equal to Goddess WangChen."

# game/script.rpy:1266
translate english b10_bbb5551c:

    # "听到这些不熟悉的名号，我就没有继续问了。三郎念了法术的下一秒后，我们降落在一间小屋旁。"
    "I stopped asking upon hearing these unfamiliar names. San Lang  recited some words and then we landed next to a small house in a second."

# game/script.rpy:1268
translate english b10_33bf8e21:

    # "这里的景色有些别致，空气中还飘着一股清香的草药味。"
    "The scenery here is very unique, I smell some herbal fragrance in the air."

# game/script.rpy:1270
translate english b10_50306d88:

    # dude7 "（看到了三郎）真是稀客啊。 （注意到了我）这位姑娘是?"
    dude7 "(Seeing San Lang) What a rare guest.  (Notices me) And who is this lady?"

# game/script.rpy:1272
translate english b10_89217805:

    # three "（还没等我答复，三郎就脱口而出）她叫萧瑀，家住京都，年纪二十有余。"
    three "(San Lan responded before I could reply)  This is Xiao Yu, she's 20 years old and lives in the capital city."

# game/script.rpy:1274
translate english b10_8c3a8fb0:

    # "等等，我好像从来没想三郎提起我的名字，年纪。他怎么知道的？我觉得有些"
    "Wait, I never mentioned my name or age to San Lang. How did he know? I am-"

# game/script.rpy:1284
translate english b11_d8b7660a:

    # mc2 "（有些吃惊）你。。你怎么打听到这些的？你是不是变态啊?"
    mc2 "(somewhat surprised) You...how did you know so much about me? Are you a creepy stalker?"

# game/script.rpy:1286
translate english b11_6969d8d0:

    # three "我在京都多时，这些东西掐指一算就知道了。（挑眉）如果我是变态，那有些小猫随便咬人又算是什么呢?"
    three "I have been here for a long time and I can easily calculate these things."
    three "(Raise eyebrows) If I'm creepy, then what do we call little kittens that casually bite people?"

# game/script.rpy:1288
translate english b11_00e9d957:

    # dude7 "（觉得气氛有些微妙，轻咳）看来姑娘受了很重的伤，三弟，你去把药房里的白色玉雕瓶拿出来吧?"
    dude7 "(Notices the subtle change of emotions, coughs)It seems like this lady's injury is quite severe, third brother, go fetch the white jade bottle from the pharmacy."

# game/script.rpy:1290
translate english b11_300f6408:

    # "三郎听到后，把我放到一个椅子上，一人独自去了药房。"
    "When San Lang heard this, he put me down on the chair and went to the pharmacy alone"

# game/script.rpy:1292
translate english b11_0e91baaf:

    # dude7 "（从地上拾起掉落的玉佩）诶，这不是四郎的贴身配饰吗，姑娘怎么会有的？（表情瞬间转变）我明白了，这是四弟赠与你的吧？哈哈"
    dude7 "(Picking up a jade pendant on the ground) Huh, isn't this Si Lang's personal accessory?"
    dude7 "Why do you have it? (his expression changed instantly) Oh, I know! This is a gift from my fourth bro? Ha ha"

# game/script.rpy:1302
translate english b12_522c2ae5:

    # mc2 "（脸色有些转变）其实也不算。哈哈，总之就是。。一言难尽"
    mc2 "(Expression changed) Actually, it's hard to explain. Haha…It's complicated."

# game/script.rpy:1304
translate english b12_5151f8c9:

    # dude7 "（看到我的脸通红）姑娘不必作答，我想我明白了。 （想到什么）好像五郎最近在找你，他差了百鸟在各个城镇打听你的消息。"
    dude7 "(Seeing I'm flustered) Miss Xiao, you do not have to answer. I understand where you're coming from."
    dude7 "(In thought) It seems like Wu Lang has been looking for you. He sent hundreds of birds to various towns to find news about you"
# game/script.rpy:1306
translate english b12_c832e0a9:

    # mc2 "这是为何？是不是因为我失踪了？"
    mc2 "Why? Is it because I was missing?"

# game/script.rpy:1307
translate english b12_26916672:

    # two "（点点头）应该是这样。刚刚忘了介绍，我是二郎，也是这府邸的主人。看来我的三弟，四弟，和五弟都挺紧张你的，你是我的哪个弟媳啊?"
    two "(Nod) Should be so. I forgot to introduce myself. I am Er Lang, the owner of this manor."
    two "It seems like my third, fourth, and fifth brother care a lot about you. If you're gonna be my sister-in-law, which of them are you dating?"
# game/script.rpy:1309
translate english b12_9c618e05:

    # "我顿时想到了"
    "Suddenly, I'm thinking of-"

# game/script.rpy:1321
translate english b13_6da13106:

    # three "（突然进来）这瓶丹药可以内服，二哥是否可以也送我一瓶?"
    three "(Coming in suddenly) This bottle of medicine can melt in liquids, brother, can you give me a bottle too?"

# game/script.rpy:1323
translate english b13_2a050de2:

    # two "你的伤势可以自行痊愈，要这丹药作甚?"
    two "Your injury can heal on its own. Why do you need them?"

# game/script.rpy:1325
translate english b13_f824efa9:

    # three "二哥日理万机，天天都有要事，这个二哥就别管了。"
    three "You're busy all the time, so don't be concerned with trivial stuff."

# game/script.rpy:1327
translate english b13_647e61b8:

    # "果然服下丹药后，我的伤势都痊愈了。向二郎道谢后，三郎带着我回到了酒楼。可是接下来的事却让我无语了。"
    "Surely enough, my injury is fully healed after taking the pill.  We bid farewell to Er Lang and San Lang brought me back to the restaurant. "
    "However, the next thing that happened left me speechless."

# game/script.rpy:1329
translate english b13_ef7f828f:

    # "我们酒楼何时变成了一个婚宴场所？"
    "When did our restaurant become a wedding venue?"

# game/script.rpy:1331
translate english b13_5a1be176:

    # "三郎似乎有些犹豫要不要进去，他本想离开。奈何我拉着他的衣袖一起进入了大厅。"
    "San Lang seemed a bit hesitant to go inside and wanted to leave. However, I pulled his sleeve and went in together."

# game/script.rpy:1333
translate english b13_4e8d744c:

    # "一开始，所有人似乎并没有发现我和三郎。当我爹娘看到我时，他们双双突然晕了过去。衣着喜服的陌生男子用着惊恐的眼神看着我。"
    "At first, no one seemed to have noticed us. When my parents saw us, they fainted.  A frightened man wearing wedding attire glared at me."

# game/script.rpy:1335
translate english b13_16b4088f:

    # b "（突然大叫）鬼啊！头七还没到，萧瑀就回来了。她旁边的一定是白无常我要先走了啊。（狼狈地跑上楼）"
    b "(Suddenly a scream)  A ghost! The seventh day after her death is not even here and Xiao Yu is back."
    b "The guard of the underworld is next to her. I need to leave. (runs upstairs embarrassingly)"

# game/script.rpy:1337
translate english b13_f3df1a70:

    # "厨子突然摔破了刚端出来的女儿红和烤鸡盘子。大厅的客人纷纷逃跑，一瞬间，大多数的客人都走了。"
    "The chef broke the jug of wine and a plate of roast duck. All the guests started to disperse. In a blink of an eye, most of the guests are gone."

# game/script.rpy:1339
translate english b13_786719f7:

    # dude8 "别杀我，我们不是说好了拜完堂之后，我就可以走了吗？姑娘，我会每年祭拜你的。"
    dude8 "Don't kill me, didn't we agree after the wedding ceremony I can leave? Miss Xiao, I will pay respect at your grave every year."

# game/script.rpy:1341
translate english b13_8655a682:

    # mc2 "你是谁啊?"
    mc2 "Who are you?"

# game/script.rpy:1343
translate english b13_26eb8cc9:

    # dude8 "我那天不小心捡到了一个红包，里面全都是头发和三文钱。是你爹娘说我必须来这里和你冥婚的。他们还说我拜完堂，为你设一个灵堂就好了"
    dude8 "I accidentally picked up a red envelope. Inside were full of hair and three pennies. Your parents said I must come here and marry you."
    dude8 "They even said I can leave after I establish a mourning hall for you."

# game/script.rpy:1345
translate english b13_36bbc5b2:

    # four "（从楼上走下来）三哥，你怎么会在这?"
    four "(came down from upstairs) Third brother, why are you here?"

# game/script.rpy:1347
translate english b13_c9326eeb:

    # "还没等三郎回复四郎，五郎突然向我走来，拉着我的手腕，把我抱入怀中"
    "Before San Lang could answer Si Lang, Wu Lang came toward me, grabbed my wrist, and pulled me into his arms"

# game/script.rpy:1349
translate english b13_f0aa471d:

    # five "太好了，你没有死！你失踪的这几天，我-- 我们都一直再找你。"
    five "That is great, you are still alive! You went missing all these days. I...we all went to look for you."

# game/script.rpy:1351
translate english b13_6f16f77c:

    # "To be continued. :D"
    "To be continued. :D"

